</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:11.135" end="00:00:14.200" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.500" end="00:00:14.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your dad.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.500" end="00:00:17.800" style="s2">Cora, I&#39;m your big brother.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.600" end="00:00:21.700" style="s2">I&#39;m brother number two.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.960" end="00:00:23.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.700" end="00:00:25.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s not knocked up</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.800" end="00:00:27.600" style="s2">by some dead</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.600" end="00:00:29.300" style="s2">I heard that you little snake and this</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.600" end="00:00:31.300" style="s2">car is a piece of junk bumpy as hell I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.300" end="00:00:32.800" style="s2">about to lose my lunk. And you call</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.300" end="00:00:33.600" style="s2">yourselves rich riding around in this</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.800" end="00:00:35.200" style="s2">piece of crap.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.600" end="00:00:36.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of car do you want Cora name</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.200" end="00:00:39.400" style="s2">it I&#39;ll buy it for</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.800" end="00:00:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course a Toyota.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.400" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re serious?</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.800" end="00:00:45.700" style="s2">You want a Toyota?</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.000" end="00:00:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there any other car on this planet?</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.700" end="00:00:49.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you even know what this car is?</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.000" end="00:00:51.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t care what it is [music] looks like</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.500" end="00:00:53.800" style="s2">a hot dog on wheels.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.400" end="00:00:55.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Disgrace mental state absolutely</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.800" end="00:00:57.000" style="s2">legendary.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.300" end="00:00:58.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cora your hair.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.000" end="00:01:00.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cool right did it myself want me to hook</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.900" end="00:01:01.900" style="s2">you up?</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.000" end="00:01:02.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that safe? Do you have a license for</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.900" end="00:01:04.400" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.300" end="00:01:06.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax it was two bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.400" end="00:01:07.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two bucks? If word gets out you&#39;re using</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.600" end="00:01:09.200" style="s2">cheap crap like that people are going to</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.900" end="00:01:11.200" style="s2">think we&#39;re going bankrupt.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.200" end="00:01:13.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cora now that you&#39;re home don&#39;t use that</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.200" end="00:01:15.100" style="s2">dye anymore mom&#39;s personal stylist has</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.700" end="00:01:17.200" style="s2">much better stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.100" end="00:01:19.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have a personal stylist?</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.200" end="00:01:20.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He works on the first floor feel free to</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.000" end="00:01:23.100" style="s2">see him anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.800" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me I&#39;m going to live here now this place</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.100" end="00:01:26.100" style="s2">is huge.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.200" end="00:01:27.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly girl.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.100" end="00:01:29.400" style="s2">You&#39;re my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.700" end="00:01:30.500" style="s2">Where else would you live?</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.400" end="00:01:33.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.500" end="00:01:35.200" style="s2">are you</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.000" end="00:01:36.200" style="s2">Where&#39;s my room show me show me show me</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.200" end="00:01:39.700" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.200" end="00:01:41.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right behind me is your bedroom.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.700" end="00:01:44.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get this whole room to myself this is</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.800" end="00:01:45.600" style="s2">way too extra. How do you even work this</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.500" end="00:01:48.000" style="s2">thing?</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.600" end="00:01:49.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey don&#39;t know no need to make that face</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.000" end="00:01:50.700" style="s2">come on let&#39;s figure it out together.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.600" end="00:01:51.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.700" end="00:01:52.200" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.200" end="00:01:53.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.200" end="00:01:54.500" style="s2">this one do? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.700" end="00:01:56.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No clue.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.500" end="00:01:57.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this?</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.200" end="00:01:59.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Also</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.500" end="00:02:00.592" style="s2">no clue.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.100" end="00:02:01.831" style="s2">I don&#39;t either.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.592" end="00:02:03.851" style="s2">Count me in.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.831" end="00:02:03.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.592" end="00:02:14.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, dad&#39;s taking us to a degustation</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.892" end="00:02:15.892" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.892" end="00:02:17.292" style="s2">Let me pick out something for you to</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.892" end="00:02:19.892" style="s2">wear.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.292" end="00:02:23.392" style="s2">Oh, what station? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.892" end="00:02:23.392" style="s2">You&#39;ll see when we get there.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.292" end="00:02:28.692" style="s2">Holy. You wanted to pick out clothes,</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.492" end="00:02:31.892" style="s2">right? These are all ones I&#39;ve worn</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.692" end="00:02:33.192" style="s2">before. Take whatever you like, sis.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.892" end="00:02:34.492" style="s2">What&#39;s with all these dresses? How am I</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.192" end="00:02:36.092" style="s2">supposed to throw a punch wearing this</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.492" end="00:02:39.792" style="s2">crap?</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.092" end="00:02:39.792" style="s2">Nah, I&#39;m not changing.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.692" end="00:02:46.192" style="s2">I&#39;m not eating this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.192" end="00:02:47.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cora, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.192" end="00:02:49.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fishy</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.492" end="00:02:51.792" style="s2">and gross.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.092" end="00:02:52.992" style="s2">Makes me feel sick.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.792" end="00:02:54.592" style="s2">What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.992" end="00:02:56.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the chocolate cocoa manor lava</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.592" end="00:02:59.892" style="s2">cake.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.092" end="00:03:02.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn. This is actually pretty good.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.892" end="00:03:03.792" style="s2">Hm, you guys aren&#39;t having any?</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.492" end="00:03:05.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re full, sis.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.792" end="00:03:08.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? Then give them all to me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.792" end="00:03:10.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have absolutely no table manners.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.492" end="00:03:12.292" style="s2">You&#39;re embarrassing yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.092" end="00:03:14.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who do you think you&#39;re talking to? It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.292" end="00:03:15.292" style="s2">just a piece of cake.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.537" end="00:03:16.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.292" end="00:03:18.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.992" end="00:03:19.792" style="s2">don&#39;t be mad at sis.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.492" end="00:03:21.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHY DID YOU PUSH SHEILA?</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.792" end="00:03:24.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I DIDN&#39;T PUSH HER.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.092" end="00:03:24.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE DID you learn to lie like this?</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.192" end="00:03:29.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See that?</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.392" end="00:03:30.992" style="s2">That&#39;s me pushing someone.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.492" end="00:03:32.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.992" end="00:03:33.592" style="s2">sis didn&#39;t mean to hit you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.592" end="00:03:35.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow,</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.592" end="00:03:37.392" style="s2">Oscar-worthy performance right there.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.592" end="00:03:39.192" style="s2">Total queen of the green tea act. Keep</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.392" end="00:03:40.492" style="s2">going. Do it again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.192" end="00:03:42.592" style="s2">Daddy, sis didn&#39;t mean to hit you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.492" end="00:03:44.492" style="s2">Please don&#39;t be mad at her. So, how&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.592" end="00:03:45.692" style="s2">impression of your pathetic act? Nailed</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.492" end="00:03:47.292" style="s2">it, didn&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.692" end="00:03:49.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, it&#39;s all my fault. I don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.292" end="00:03:51.692" style="s2">what I can do. I&#39;m too young. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.992" end="00:03:53.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Sheila, how about you just give her</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.692" end="00:03:55.892" style="s2">the third floor?</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.792" end="00:03:56.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother, wait. I get THE THIRD FLOOR?</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.892" end="00:04:00.692" style="s2">ARE YOU SERIOUS?</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.992" end="00:04:00.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE each get our own floor in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.092" end="00:04:06.794" style="s2">Uncle Orlando, sorry to intrude. I heard</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.294" end="00:04:07.494" style="s2">you were here and I wanted to come say</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.794" end="00:04:09.394" style="s2">hello.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.494" end="00:04:10.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gavin, you&#39;re here too.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.394" end="00:04:11.894" style="s2">Gavin, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.394" end="00:04:13.094" style="s2">this is Cora.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.894" end="00:04:14.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.094" end="00:04:16.694" style="s2">You free tomorrow? Let me take you to</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.394" end="00:04:16.694" style="s2">lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.417" end="00:04:21.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.794" end="00:04:21.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I even know you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.094" end="00:04:29.294" style="s2">Wait, what?</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.494" end="00:04:30.694" style="s2">He&#39;s my fiancé. You</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.294" end="00:04:33.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go take a walk downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.694" end="00:04:35.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, hold on. I&#39;ve got questions.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.694" end="00:04:35.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want me to hook you up with some new</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.194" end="00:04:35.994" style="s2">threads?</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.758" end="00:04:38.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.994" end="00:04:40.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hell yeah. Only a would turn that</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.494" end="00:04:42.094" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.394" end="00:04:45.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wasn&#39;t sure what you&#39;d like, so I just</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.094" end="00:04:45.194" style="s2">got the latest bestseller.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.494" end="00:04:48.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this? Why does it smell like</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.694" end="00:04:50.594" style="s2">cheap perfume?</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.794" end="00:04:52.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want for lunch? My treat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.594" end="00:04:55.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; McDonald&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.294" end="00:04:55.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; McDonald&#39;s, all right.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.194" end="00:04:58.594" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.694" end="00:04:59.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you driving a piece of junk,</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.594" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.994" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.268" end="00:05:05.288" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.494" end="00:05:10.294" style="s2">Get on.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.294" end="00:05:10.294" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you for a ride.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.594" end="00:05:14.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you trying to</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.194" end="00:05:16.194" style="s2">get us killed?</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.294" end="00:05:18.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scooters have</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.194" end="00:05:20.094" style="s2">SPEED LIMITS.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.294" end="00:05:22.394" style="s2">MCDONALD&#39;S,</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.094" end="00:05:22.394" style="s2">HERE I COME.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.294" end="00:05:30.194" style="s2">GOOD, RIGHT?</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.894" end="00:05:31.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.194" end="00:05:33.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what? Just wait outside.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.794" end="00:05:35.294" style="s2">Watching you sit there is making me</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.294" end="00:05:36.694" style="s2">uncomfortable. I hate forcing people.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.294" end="00:05:38.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After we eat, I&#39;ll take you to buy a</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.694" end="00:05:39.494" style="s2">car.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.094" end="00:05:41.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buy a car?</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.494" end="00:05:42.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You get car sick, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.294" end="00:05:43.994" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you one that doesn&#39;t make you</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.394" end="00:05:45.694" style="s2">sick.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.994" end="00:05:47.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re asking me out again?</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.694" end="00:05:48.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our families have an engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.694" end="00:05:50.994" style="s2">That&#39;s not changing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.994" end="00:05:52.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then marry Sheila. Why drag me into</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.994" end="00:05:54.494" style="s2">this? You got nothing better to do?</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.894" end="00:05:56.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll have to ask Uncle Orlando about</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.494" end="00:05:59.094" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.894" end="00:06:01.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, what model are you interested in?</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.094" end="00:06:03.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything that seats a person.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.494" end="00:06:07.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is our bestseller, top-notch</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.394" end="00:06:07.095" style="s2">comfort. Want to give it a try?</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.424" end="00:06:11.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.895" end="00:06:14.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nope. Nope. None of these work.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.695" end="00:06:14.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about that one over there?</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.795" end="00:06:18.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is it. This is the one.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.495" end="00:06:20.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring it up.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.595" end="00:06:21.215" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what about freebies? Even a bicycle</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.295" end="00:06:22.395" style="s2">comes with a lock. Don&#39;t be cheap.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.215" end="00:06:24.395" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.395" end="00:06:26.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, we usually don&#39;t do giveaways.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.395" end="00:06:29.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No freebies? Then I&#39;m not buying.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.395" end="00:06:29.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Okay. I&#39;ll throw something in.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.695" end="00:06:35.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s more like it. See? That&#39;s how you</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.395" end="00:06:37.195" style="s2">do business. Generous.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.795" end="00:06:41.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send the latest runway collection to</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.195" end="00:06:44.295" style="s2">Sheila. This woman is something else.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.495" end="00:06:44.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jackpot.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.395" end="00:06:49.595" style="s2">Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.895" end="00:06:50.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, honey. What&#39;s wrong? Why are you</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.595" end="00:06:52.095" style="s2">crying?</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.795" end="00:06:53.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you were really going to send</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.095" end="00:06:54.619" style="s2">me away. I thought you didn&#39;t want me</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.595" end="00:06:55.095" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.619" end="00:06:56.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.095" end="00:06:59.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, of course not. You&#39;re my</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.795" end="00:07:01.195" style="s2">baby girl. Always have been.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.195" end="00:07:02.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you send Gavin after my sister?</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.195" end="00:07:04.295" style="s2">He was supposed to be my fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.695" end="00:07:05.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, weren&#39;t you the one who wanted</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.295" end="00:07:06.795" style="s2">out? You were screaming to break it off</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.395" end="00:07:08.595" style="s2">just a few weeks ago. Isn&#39;t this what</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.795" end="00:07:09.595" style="s2">you asked for? Look, Kira is different.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.595" end="00:07:10.995" style="s2">She&#39;s not like you. She doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.595" end="00:07:12.295" style="s2">understand this world. I&#39;m just trying</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.995" end="00:07:13.495" style="s2">to set her up with someone decent,</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.295" end="00:07:16.495" style="s2">someone who can take care of her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.495" end="00:07:18.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I get it, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.495" end="00:07:19.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cora,</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.095" end="00:07:20.695" style="s2">what do you think of Gavin?</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.595" end="00:07:22.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.695" end="00:07:23.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.095" end="00:07:25.395" style="s2">Daddy set you up with him, you know,</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.440" end="00:07:26.595" style="s2">[music] as your husband?</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.395" end="00:07:27.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hard pass. Not.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.595" end="00:07:28.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.095" end="00:07:30.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s way too old. I feel nothing for</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.895" end="00:07:32.665" style="s2">him. Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.645" end="00:07:32.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.495" end="00:07:38.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.695" end="00:07:38.295" style="s2">Cora, get under your skin again?</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.695" end="00:07:42.895" style="s2">Go talk to your sister.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.895" end="00:07:44.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, little sis. Heard someone&#39;s trying</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.895" end="00:07:45.895" style="s2">to force you into a marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.795" end="00:07:47.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.895" end="00:07:49.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know Sheila went to Dad&#39;s study</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.695" end="00:07:50.795" style="s2">right after you left today.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.095" end="00:07:52.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left early. Who cares?</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.795" end="00:07:53.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess what she went there for.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.395" end="00:07:54.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not my problem.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.795" end="00:07:56.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wants Gavin.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.795" end="00:07:57.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then give him to her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.295" end="00:07:58.995" style="s2">She can have him.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.095" end="00:08:00.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad didn&#39;t agree.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.995" end="00:08:01.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? Did he lose his mind?</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.395" end="00:08:03.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad told her you don&#39;t have much social</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.995" end="00:08:05.295" style="s2">experience</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.395" end="00:08:06.695" style="s2">and that no one would want to marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.295" end="00:08:07.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, hell no. He said I can&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.695" end="00:08:08.797" style="s2">married. I&#39;m going down there right now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.795" end="00:08:10.197" style="s2">I&#39;m going to have a little talk with him</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.797" end="00:08:12.397" style="s2">and see who&#39;s the one with no taint.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.197" end="00:08:13.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm down. Let me finish.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.397" end="00:08:15.097" style="s2">That was just dad trying to keep her</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.897" end="00:08:16.097" style="s2">happy. You didn&#39;t actually believe that,</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.097" end="00:08:17.797" style="s2">did you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.097" end="00:08:19.397" style="s2">Gavin&#39;s family is a complete mess right</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.797" end="00:08:20.497" style="s2">now. The shares mom left him, he locked</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.397" end="00:08:21.497" style="s2">all of them. Now he&#39;s just working at</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.497" end="00:08:23.097" style="s2">the company like everyone else. Their</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.497" end="00:08:24.197" style="s2">whole house is falling apart.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.097" end="00:08:24.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? What does that have to do with</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.197" end="00:08:25.797" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.697" end="00:08:26.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you&#39;re the real daughter of this</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.797" end="00:08:27.597" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.797" end="00:08:28.997" style="s2">For people like them, they don&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.597" end="00:08:30.797" style="s2">whether you&#39;re good at socializing or</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.997" end="00:08:33.097" style="s2">not. They care about benefits,</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.797" end="00:08:34.997" style="s2">connections, resources. Dad wants to</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.097" end="00:08:36.297" style="s2">help Gavin, but first Gavin has to</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.997" end="00:08:37.797" style="s2">become dad&#39;s son-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.297" end="00:08:39.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds disgusting. Aren&#39;t girls</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.797" end="00:08:41.797" style="s2">just something they use to make deals?</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.297" end="00:08:42.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I mean. You and Sheila,</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.797" end="00:08:44.597" style="s2">neither of you can get involved in the</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.997" end="00:08:46.397" style="s2">company&#39;s business.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.597" end="00:08:48.297" style="s2">That&#39;s the only point I&#39;m making.</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.397" end="00:08:49.597" style="s2">Anyway, you better watch your back.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.297" end="00:08:52.697" style="s2">Sheila is definitely going to try to</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.597" end="00:08:52.697" style="s2">make things difficult for you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.097" end="00:08:57.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, I heard you and Gavin are getting</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.397" end="00:08:59.097" style="s2">along pretty well.</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.097" end="00:09:00.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See, told you. Here she goes.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.097" end="00:09:03.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you that? Quit spreading</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.797" end="00:09:05.197" style="s2">rumors. Just a guess, sis.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.397" end="00:09:07.097" style="s2">Don&#39;t don&#39;t be so touchy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.197" end="00:09:10.097" style="s2">Worry about yourself. My business ain&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.097" end="00:09:10.697" style="s2">yours. Dad, Winston&#39;s inviting sis to</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.097" end="00:09:12.597" style="s2">dinner.</p>
