<p begin="00:09:12.597" end="00:09:16.897" style="s2">argument.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.297" end="00:09:16.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.997" end="00:09:19.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:22.497" style="s2">the Broad family.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.397" end="00:09:25.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Winston&#39;s pretty cute.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.497" end="00:09:25.897" style="s2">You&#39;re definitely scheming something.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.597" end="00:09:31.166" style="s2">Is this the same fake smile she gave you</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.097" end="00:09:31.597" style="s2">when she screwed you over?</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.166" end="00:09:33.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.597" end="00:09:34.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cora, take the driver.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.497" end="00:09:36.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.497" end="00:09:37.597" style="s2">Take me where? You couldn&#39;t even buy me</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.097" end="00:09:38.197" style="s2">a Toyota and now you&#39;re playing daddy of</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.597" end="00:09:40.497" style="s2">the year?</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.197" end="00:09:42.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Out the way. Out of the way. I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.497" end="00:09:43.397" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.497" end="00:09:47.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look like you&#39;re trying to get me</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.397" end="00:09:47.297" style="s2">killed before 30. I&#39;ll walk. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.597" end="00:09:50.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heard you&#39;ve got a date today.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.797" end="00:09:51.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.497" end="00:09:54.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe you need a chauffeur.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.997" end="00:09:56.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And a total simp. Got to hand it to you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.597" end="00:09:58.697" style="s2">Rich as hell and still simping this</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.397" end="00:09:58.697" style="s2">hard.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.997" end="00:10:03.897" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
