<p begin="00:10:03.897" end="00:10:06.697" style="s2">wrong seat. Isn&#39;t the front passenger</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.597" end="00:10:07.497" style="s2">seat usually reserved for someone</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.697" end="00:10:09.497" style="s2">special?</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.497" end="00:10:10.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wrong seat [music] says who? I&#39;ll sit</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.497" end="00:10:12.198" style="s2">wherever the hell I want.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.698" end="00:10:14.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, sis. Come on. Winston ought</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.198" end="00:10:16.298" style="s2">to be here already.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.898" end="00:10:18.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.298" end="00:10:19.798" style="s2">you&#39;re Winston?</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.298" end="00:10:21.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.798" end="00:10:22.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Winston, I&#39;ll leave my sister in your</p>
