<p begin="00:10:24.498" end="00:10:29.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.698" end="00:10:30.998" style="s2">Got this for you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.298" end="00:10:33.198" style="s2">That&#39;s eight bucks.</p>
