<p begin="00:10:36.298" end="00:10:41.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You literally just spit it back out.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.298" end="00:10:43.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t swallow, so it doesn&#39;t count.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.498" end="00:10:45.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got to take responsibility</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.698" end="00:10:47.798" style="s2">for what you order.</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.298" end="00:10:50.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.798" end="00:10:51.998" style="s2">You like it so much, drink it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.098" end="00:10:54.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. Forget it. Keep your money,</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.998" end="00:10:54.298" style="s2">okay?</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.352" end="00:10:56.372" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.398" end="00:11:00.898" style="s2">Where are you going? Aren&#39;t we eating?</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.798" end="00:11:02.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re insane.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.898" end="00:11:03.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, my brother&#39;s going to kill me if</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.398" end="00:11:05.498" style="s2">I come home empty-handed. How about we</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.898" end="00:11:06.998" style="s2">just split the bill, please?</p>
