<p begin="00:11:09.598" end="00:11:13.298" style="s2">split it, but I pick where we eat.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.498" end="00:11:16.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so good at saving money. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.698" end="00:11:19.898" style="s2">just get married. Two bucks a meal,</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.698" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">we&#39;re a match made in heaven.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.898" end="00:11:21.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Split the bill.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.898" end="00:11:22.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.598" end="00:11:24.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d rather eat with Gavin than with you.</p>
