<p begin="00:11:24.698" end="00:11:27.798" style="s2">taco joint like this. Look how much I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.298" end="00:11:28.598" style="s2">enjoying this. We&#39;re perfect for each</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.798" end="00:11:30.398" style="s2">other.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.598" end="00:11:32.098" style="s2">Don&#39;t go. I&#39;m on a date here. Strolling</p>
