<p begin="00:11:35.498" end="00:11:38.898" style="s2">married.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.398" end="00:11:39.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey handsome, give me a ride. Anywhere</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.898" end="00:11:40.798" style="s2">is fine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.598" end="00:11:42.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can just hit your ride like that. I</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.798" end="00:11:44.598" style="s2">want A RIDE, TOO.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.898" end="00:11:45.998" style="s2">I DIDN&#39;T GET IN YET. WAIT UP.</p>
