<p begin="00:12:10.698" end="00:12:13.899" style="s2">I I trust your intentions.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.599" end="00:12:18.699" style="s2">Why&#39;d you transfer me money?</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.299" end="00:12:19.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cab fare.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.699" end="00:12:21.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not going to be my driver</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.699" end="00:12:24.999" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.399" end="00:12:28.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just call me next time you go out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.999" end="00:12:28.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seduction, who can&#39;t do that?</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.599" end="00:12:31.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go to the Emerson&#39;s birthday party</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.799" end="00:12:32.603" style="s2">together the day after tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.299" end="00:12:34.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Winston,</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.603" end="00:12:36.399" style="s2">[snorts] what the hell is wrong with</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.099" end="00:12:38.099" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.399" end="00:12:39.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You take a rich heiress out [music] and</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.099" end="00:12:41.799" style="s2">you still split the bill? Are you doing</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.599" end="00:12:43.599" style="s2">this on purpose to pick a fight with me?</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.799" end="00:12:45.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty much. [music] Bro, you&#39;re living</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.599" end="00:12:47.668" style="s2">way too waste.</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.399" end="00:12:48.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, suit yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.668" end="00:12:51.499" style="s2">[music] But why did you take her to</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.599" end="00:12:54.299" style="s2">Taco? Didn&#39;t I tell you to use my card?</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.499" end="00:12:54.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was her idea.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.999" end="00:12:58.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, [music] you can head back</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.799" end="00:12:59.699" style="s2">now. I&#39;ll have someone set you up with</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.499" end="00:13:03.399" style="s2">someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.699" end="00:13:03.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. I only want Cora.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.299" end="00:13:10.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two really hit it off, huh? It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.899" end="00:13:11.699" style="s2">awesome. Cora, look.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.099" end="00:13:13.799" style="s2">Someone&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.699" end="00:13:16.999" style="s2">Winston&#39;s thinking about you. Look, he</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.799" end="00:13:16.999" style="s2">even brought you a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.599" end="00:13:19.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis,</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.384" end="00:13:24.404" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.499" end="00:13:30.299" style="s2">Winston&#39;s really put thought into this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.699" end="00:13:34.174" style="s2">You made this kindergarten craft class?</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.899" end="00:13:36.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.174" end="00:13:38.599" style="s2">[music] Take it and then add me back.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.299" end="00:13:40.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No chance. Stop dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.599" end="00:13:42.699" style="s2">Winston&#39;s that into you. You can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.599" end="00:13:44.899" style="s2">break his heart, you know?</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.699" end="00:13:46.899" style="s2">Sincere, where&#39;s the sincerity? Didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.899" end="00:13:48.299" style="s2">you two also go on a date the day before</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.899" end="00:13:49.099" style="s2">yesterday? Why don&#39;t you get together</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.299" end="00:13:50.199" style="s2">with him?</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.099" end="00:13:52.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.199" end="00:13:55.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, marriage is no joke. This is</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.299" end="00:13:56.399" style="s2">Cora&#39;s own affair. Don&#39;t meddle.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.134" end="00:13:59.599" style="s2">[music] You weren&#39;t raised by this</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.399" end="00:14:02.099" style="s2">family. You owe us nothing. You&#39;re free.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.599" end="00:14:02.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.499" end="00:14:06.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promised Gavin I&#39;d go with him to his</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.099" end="00:14:08.299" style="s2">father&#39;s birthday banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.999" end="00:14:10.699" style="s2">He&#39;ll come pick me up.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.299" end="00:14:12.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? Gavin invited you?</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.699" end="00:14:14.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the problem?</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.499" end="00:14:16.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But aren&#39;t we dating? Shouldn&#39;t you be</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.199" end="00:14:18.001" style="s2">going with me?</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.101" end="00:14:19.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re dating. Since when?</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.001" end="00:14:21.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.801" end="00:14:25.701" style="s2">When we were walking together, we</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.801" end="00:14:25.701" style="s2">already swapped saliva and</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.901" end="00:14:28.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.201" end="00:14:31.101" style="s2">Cora,</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.301" end="00:14:31.101" style="s2">you kissed him?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.814" end="00:14:33.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.901" end="00:14:35.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.901" end="00:14:36.400" style="s2">Stop making things up. I didn&#39;t kiss</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.701" end="00:14:37.501" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.400" end="00:14:39.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.501" end="00:14:40.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You put your coffee cup to my lips</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.101" end="00:14:42.401" style="s2">yesterday. Doesn&#39;t that count?</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.701" end="00:14:43.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only because you scammed me out of two</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.401" end="00:14:45.401" style="s2">bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.401" end="00:14:46.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re not short on money. Here. I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.401" end="00:14:47.101" style="s2">you a [music] card. Spend whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.701" end="00:14:48.901" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.101" end="00:14:49.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. Gavin already transferred me</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.901" end="00:14:51.401" style="s2">20,000.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.901" end="00:14:52.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much? Well, that&#39;s pretty generous</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.401" end="00:14:55.701" style="s2">of him, but we really did</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.801" end="00:14:59.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say one more word. I dare you. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.701" end="00:14:59.601" style="s2">interested, so stop wasting your time.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.980" end="00:15:02.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.530" end="00:15:08.550" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.101" end="00:15:13.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do I look?</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.901" end="00:15:15.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.701" end="00:15:17.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Picked it out just for you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.700" end="00:15:19.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.201" end="00:15:19.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.001" end="00:15:22.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Toyota? [music] Where&#39;d that come</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.301" end="00:15:23.901" style="s2">from?</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.201" end="00:15:25.301" style="s2">It&#39;s a broke joke doing at the Emerson</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.901" end="00:15:29.001" style="s2">State.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.301" end="00:15:29.001" style="s2">How did security even let that in?</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.455" end="00:15:31.475" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.701" end="00:15:36.201" style="s2">That&#39;s Gavin. Why&#39;s he driving a car</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.201" end="00:15:38.501" style="s2">like that? And who&#39;s that girl? Her</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.201" end="00:15:40.001" style="s2">hair&#39;s a mess. Looks like a turkey.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.501" end="00:15:41.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.001" end="00:15:44.601" style="s2">please perform a piece for your Uncle</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.301" end="00:15:46.901" style="s2">Emerson&#39;s celebration of his birthday.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.601" end="00:15:49.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, there are so many elders here</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.901" end="00:15:51.601" style="s2">tonight. I&#39;d be too embarrassed to show</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.105" end="00:15:51.601" style="s2">[music] off.</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.301" end="00:15:56.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.345" end="00:15:56.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.701" end="00:16:00.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother moves fast. The Orlando girl</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.501" end="00:16:00.801" style="s2">just got found and you&#39;re already</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.101" end="00:16:02.701" style="s2">cozying up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.801" end="00:16:04.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tired. Want to go rest for a bit?</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.701" end="00:16:05.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest [music] sounds good. Not a fan of</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.501" end="00:16:07.801" style="s2">barking.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.801" end="00:16:09.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you calling a dog?</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.801" end="00:16:11.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it goes again. So [music] much</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.801" end="00:16:14.651" style="s2">barking. Loud, too.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.901" end="00:16:17.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s not listen.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.651" end="00:16:17.702" style="s2">[music] Why are you looking at me?</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.301" end="00:16:18.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.702" end="00:16:21.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.902" end="00:16:21.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What don&#39;t you get?</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.201" end="00:16:23.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.902" end="00:16:26.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you invite me? You know exactly</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.902" end="00:16:27.202" style="s2">what my father&#39;s scheming.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.002" end="00:16:28.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you scared [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.202" end="00:16:30.902" style="s2">I might hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.702" end="00:16:32.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to throw money at me, then</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.902" end="00:16:33.902" style="s2">you&#39;d bury me with it because if you</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.702" end="00:16:36.402" style="s2">don&#39;t, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.902" end="00:16:38.002" style="s2">I&#39;m not saying yes.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.402" end="00:16:40.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Rest here. [music] I&#39;ll go check</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.002" end="00:16:40.802" style="s2">on things outside.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.471" end="00:16:45.491" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.401" end="00:16:49.421" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.602" end="00:16:54.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get me to a hospital. IT HURTS SO MUCH.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.902" end="00:17:00.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was he harassing you just now?</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.102" end="00:17:02.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Him? [music] That&#39;s a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.202" end="00:17:03.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Collin, what happened to you? Someone</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.202" end="00:17:05.902" style="s2">get the second young master to the</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.702" end="00:17:07.702" style="s2">hospital now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.902" end="00:17:09.002" style="s2">I want an explanation. What exactly is</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.702" end="00:17:10.402" style="s2">going on here?</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.002" end="00:17:12.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe you should ask your precious son</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.402" end="00:17:13.702" style="s2">what he was doing just now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.202" end="00:17:14.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gavin, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.702" end="00:17:16.902" style="s2">he&#39;s your brother.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.902" end="00:17:19.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I seem to remember my mother only gave</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.902" end="00:17:19.902" style="s2">birth to one child.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.002" end="00:17:24.002" style="s2">If I can get you under my control, I can</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.902" end="00:17:26.302" style="s2">push Gavin out of the company.</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.002" end="00:17:28.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you get that recording?</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.302" end="00:17:31.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He lunged at me first. Of course, I had</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.502" end="00:17:33.902" style="s2">to keep proof. I&#39;m not stupid.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.302" end="00:17:36.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re something else.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.902" end="00:17:39.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emerson, you owe me an explanation. Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.402" end="00:17:40.802" style="s2">Orlando, I truly had no idea about this.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.102" end="00:17:42.702" style="s2">Cora, just give your uncle some time. I</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.802" end="00:17:46.902" style="s2">promise I&#39;ll make this right for you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.702" end="00:17:46.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Handle it however you see fit.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.702" end="00:17:53.202" style="s2">Cora Orlando.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.627" end="00:17:54.602" style="s2">[singing] I&#39;m Cora Norris.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.202" end="00:17:56.202" style="s2">Now that you&#39;re back with the Orlandos,</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.602" end="00:17:57.602" style="s2">why haven&#39;t you changed your last name?</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.202" end="00:18:00.102" style="s2">Still holding a grudge?</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.602" end="00:18:03.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None of your [music] damn business.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.102" end="00:18:04.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, you can&#39;t talk to Kitty like that.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.002" end="00:18:07.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So?</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.602" end="00:18:08.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could you be like this, sis?</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.002" end="00:18:11.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You talk too much. You&#39;re Sheila&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.902" end="00:18:12.552" style="s2">sister, so of course I care about you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.202" end="00:18:14.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you really? I think you know very</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.552" end="00:18:15.702" style="s2">[music] well whether this is concern or</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.002" end="00:18:17.302" style="s2">harassment.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.702" end="00:18:18.702" style="s2">The Orlando family&#39;s affairs are none of</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.302" end="00:18:19.802" style="s2">your business.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.702" end="00:18:21.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, now you&#39;re playing the knight in</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.802" end="00:18:22.903" style="s2">shining armor. Weren&#39;t [music] you just</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.503" end="00:18:24.703" style="s2">following Sheila around like a lovesick</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.903" end="00:18:26.323" style="s2">puppy, found yourself a new monster?</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.703" end="00:18:28.343" style="s2">You&#39;re quite the loyal mutt, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.323" end="00:18:28.343" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.003" end="00:18:34.003" style="s2">I&#39;ll say this one last time. My name is</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.903" end="00:18:35.503" style="s2">Cora Norris. You dared to hit me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.003" end="00:18:38.003" style="s2">I did. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.503" end="00:18:43.303" style="s2">So what? Kitty, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.003" end="00:18:43.303" style="s2">You dare hit me. I&#39;ll beat you to death.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.337" end="00:18:45.357" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.203" end="00:18:51.003" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing [music] but someone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.603" end="00:18:53.303" style="s2">pawn.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.003" end="00:18:55.703" style="s2">Can&#39;t you see it? She&#39;s using you as a</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.303" end="00:18:58.003" style="s2">weapon, and here you are going all in</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.703" end="00:19:00.903" style="s2">like a fool. Stop trying to drive a</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.003" end="00:19:02.103" style="s2">wedge between me and Sheila.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.903" end="00:19:04.503" style="s2">Really? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.103" end="00:19:06.903" style="s2">If she truly cared, why didn&#39;t she come</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.503" end="00:19:09.503" style="s2">charging up here to hit me herself?</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.903" end="00:19:09.503" style="s2">Idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.538" end="00:19:13.303" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.403" end="00:19:14.778" style="s2">Sis, you&#39;re really going to destroy our</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.303" end="00:19:16.403" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.778" end="00:19:18.003" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.403" end="00:19:20.203" style="s2">You think Gavin&#39;s helping you out of the</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.003" end="00:19:22.003" style="s2">goodness of his heart?</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.203" end="00:19:25.003" style="s2">All he cares about is that development</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.003" end="00:19:27.603" style="s2">project in the East District.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.003" end="00:19:29.103" style="s2">Don&#39;t be naive.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.603" end="00:19:31.803" style="s2">I know that,</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.103" end="00:19:33.703" style="s2">but I never asked him to help.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.803" end="00:19:35.703" style="s2">Tell me, who&#39;s the one getting beaten up</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.703" end="00:19:38.303" style="s2">right now?</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.703" end="00:19:40.503" style="s2">Is getting your ass kicked fun for you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.303" end="00:19:42.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.503" end="00:19:45.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not planning to get up yet.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.903" end="00:19:49.203" style="s2">Kitty, are you okay? Did she hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.703" end="00:19:49.203" style="s2">Sheila, why didn&#39;t you come help me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.303" end="00:19:54.103" style="s2">Out here in front of everyone, she</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.603" end="00:19:54.103" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t really dare do anything to you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.703" end="00:19:58.603" style="s2">Cora Norris, this cake [music] is pretty</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.703" end="00:20:00.628" style="s2">good. You should try some.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.603" end="00:20:02.903" style="s2">Kitty, what are you saying to my sister?</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.628" end="00:20:04.703" style="s2">[music] Nothing much. Just thought the</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.903" end="00:20:07.103" style="s2">cake was nice and wanted her to have a</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.703" end="00:20:08.803" style="s2">taste.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.103" end="00:20:10.803" style="s2">Do you mind me calling you that? Weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.803" end="00:20:12.303" style="s2">you just calling her Cora Orlando? Cora</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.803" end="00:20:13.103" style="s2">didn&#39;t grow up in the Orlando family.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.303" end="00:20:15.203" style="s2">There&#39;s [music] nothing wrong with her</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.103" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">not wanting to take the name.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.203" end="00:20:19.803" style="s2">Speaking of which, Sheila, you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:21.103" style="s2">actually an Orlando daughter either.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.803" end="00:20:22.244" style="s2">Shouldn&#39;t you be thinking about changing</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.103" end="00:20:22.503" style="s2">your name, too?</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.244" end="00:20:23.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.503" end="00:20:25.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kitty, I am an Orlando</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.705" end="00:20:26.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; daughter. Why are you doing this to me?</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.405" end="00:20:28.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Also,</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.605" end="00:20:31.105" style="s2">don&#39;t call me Kitty anymore. Only my</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.105" end="00:20:31.105" style="s2">family [music] gets to call me that.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.705" end="00:20:34.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you saying</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.105" end="00:20:36.105" style="s2">we&#39;re not friends anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.605" end="00:20:39.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. [music] This is how it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.105" end="00:20:39.005" style="s2">going to be from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.894" end="00:20:45.305" style="s2">[music] Are we that close? Fine. You</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.305" end="00:20:46.505" style="s2">trailed me in the hall, but now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.305" end="00:20:48.305" style="s2">following me to the bathroom. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.505" end="00:20:50.605" style="s2">That&#39;s a little creepy, don&#39;t you think?</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.305" end="00:20:53.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I You&#39;re done playing with Sheila.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.605" end="00:20:53.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. I&#39;ve had enough of her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.029" end="00:20:54.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.305" end="00:20:55.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why don&#39;t you just go home? Why</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.505" end="00:20:57.105" style="s2">stick around here?</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.405" end="00:20:58.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually,</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.105" end="00:21:01.205" style="s2">I just wanted to warn you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.905" end="00:21:03.005" style="s2">Sheila is out to get you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.205" end="00:21:04.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.005" end="00:21:06.129" style="s2">She wants me out of the Orlando family.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.505" end="00:21:07.905" style="s2">I&#39;ve known that all along.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.129" end="00:21:09.905" style="s2">[music] Anyway, just watch your back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.905" end="00:21:11.005" style="s2">Sheila cheats.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.905" end="00:21:12.405" style="s2">I get it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.005" end="00:21:13.989" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.405" end="00:21:17.305" style="s2">Stay away from Sheila from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.989" end="00:21:17.305" style="s2">[music] You&#39;re no match for her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.884" end="00:21:21.904" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.905" end="00:21:29.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila&#39;s performance was so brilliant.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.105" end="00:21:31.905" style="s2">Cora, shouldn&#39;t you show us what you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.405" end="00:21:31.905" style="s2">got too?</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.205" end="00:21:34.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be like that.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.505" end="00:21:36.005" style="s2">Sister Cora has been through a lot</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.705" end="00:21:37.105" style="s2">growing up.</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.005" end="00:21:38.505" style="s2">You shouldn&#39;t pressure her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.105" end="00:21:39.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t play.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.505" end="00:21:40.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what?</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.205" end="00:21:42.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re this brazen about it even when</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.905" end="00:21:44.005" style="s2">you can&#39;t play? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.705" end="00:21:46.085" style="s2">No wonder you&#39;re so bitter towards</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.005" end="00:21:47.605" style="s2">Sheila. You&#39;re just petty.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.085" end="00:21:50.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.605" end="00:21:52.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, petty? Dude, [music] did a honky</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.405" end="00:21:53.905" style="s2">kick you in the head or something?</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.005" end="00:21:55.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s had 20 years of luxury in the</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.905" end="00:21:57.305" style="s2">Orlando family</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.605" end="00:21:58.530" style="s2">while I was practically begging on the</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.305" end="00:22:00.305" style="s2">streets.</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.530" end="00:22:02.305" style="s2">[music] Now that I&#39;m back, she&#39;s putting</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.305" end="00:22:03.705" style="s2">on a piano performance. What&#39;s that</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.305" end="00:22:05.705" style="s2">supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.705" end="00:22:07.405" style="s2">Playing it for me to remind me how much</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.705" end="00:22:08.605" style="s2">better her life&#39;s been?</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.405" end="00:22:10.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila,</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.605" end="00:22:12.505" style="s2">did you put him up to this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.405" end="00:22:14.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, sis. I I swear I didn&#39;t tell him to</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.505" end="00:22:15.305" style="s2">do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.005" end="00:22:16.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.305" end="00:22:19.005" style="s2">Then you&#39;re [music] just a pathetic</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.405" end="00:22:20.405" style="s2">little simp with no self-respect.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.005" end="00:22:21.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not.</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.405" end="00:22:23.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, you are.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.905" end="00:22:25.505" style="s2">Sheila and I are actually on great terms</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.605" end="00:22:27.906" style="s2">behind the scenes, [music] and yet here</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.505" end="00:22:30.206" style="s2">you are trying to start trouble with me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.906" end="00:22:31.906" style="s2">If you&#39;re not a simp, what are you?</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.206" end="00:22:33.506" style="s2">You can&#39;t even do that, right? No wonder</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.906" end="00:22:36.306" style="s2">she doesn&#39;t even spare you a glance when</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.506" end="00:22:37.906" style="s2">she&#39;s busy cozying up to Gavin.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.306" end="00:22:39.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she telling the truth, Sheila?</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.906" end="00:22:41.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t listen to her. She&#39;s lying.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.406" end="00:22:42.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Lying?</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.406" end="00:22:44.506" style="s2">Are you saying we don&#39;t have a good</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.306" end="00:22:45.906" style="s2">relationship, pathetic simp? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.506" end="00:22:47.106" style="s2">That you hate me?</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.906" end="00:22:48.706" style="s2">That you&#39;ve been the one pulling the</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.106" end="00:22:50.906" style="s2">strings all along, sending Kelly and</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.706" end="00:22:53.306" style="s2">this pathetic simp after me?</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.906" end="00:22:55.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.306" end="00:22:56.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard that. She just called you a</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.306" end="00:22:58.406" style="s2">simp.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.506" end="00:23:00.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I meant at all.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.406" end="00:23:02.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen up. [music] Being a simp for a</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.406" end="00:23:04.506" style="s2">girl will get you nowhere. Sheila&#39;s got</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.706" end="00:23:06.306" style="s2">her eyes set on Gavin. [music] You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.506" end="00:23:08.406" style="s2">stand a chance. My father&#39;s trying to</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.306" end="00:23:10.406" style="s2">set Gavin up as my fiancé, and to keep</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.406" end="00:23:12.306" style="s2">him, Sheila&#39;s been trying to pawn me off</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.406" end="00:23:14.006" style="s2">on someone else. She set me up with</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.306" end="00:23:16.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, me. Cora and I just had a</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.006" end="00:23:17.606" style="s2">blind date, and it went pretty damn well</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.006" end="00:23:20.706" style="s2">if you ask me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.606" end="00:23:22.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, you lied [music] to me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.706" end="00:23:23.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.206" end="00:23:25.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you stop pretending? You&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.906" end="00:23:27.611" style="s2">one who introduced Cora to me, you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.806" end="00:23:29.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.611" end="00:23:29.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.406" end="00:23:33.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.606" end="00:23:36.306" style="s2">You&#39;ll never see me again.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.206" end="00:23:39.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Let me explain.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.306" end="00:23:41.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can tell you&#39;re actually into me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.306" end="00:23:42.006" style="s2">I&#39;ve decided to be generous and give you</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.006" end="00:23:44.106" style="s2">another chance.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.006" end="00:23:45.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I honestly want to crack your skull open</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.106" end="00:23:47.206" style="s2">with a hammer.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.306" end="00:23:48.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gavin, do you even realize what you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.206" end="00:23:50.406" style="s2">doing?</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.571" end="00:23:51.606" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.406" end="00:23:53.606" style="s2">You don&#39;t need to worry about the</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.606" end="00:23:55.106" style="s2">company anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.606" end="00:23:56.706" style="s2">Collins is a grown man now. It&#39;s time</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.106" end="00:23:58.006" style="s2">for him to take over.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.706" end="00:23:59.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want the truth? I&#39;ve had it with</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.006" end="00:24:02.106" style="s2">your hypocrisy and with Collins&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.706" end="00:24:06.006" style="s2">pathetic act. I&#39;m done with all of it,</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.106" end="00:24:06.006" style="s2">this family, this house, everything.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.531" end="00:24:11.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.306" end="00:24:13.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.906" end="00:24:14.606" style="s2">Got kicked out?</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.106" end="00:24:16.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve had enough of them for years. My</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:18.606" style="s2">dad&#39;s been waiting for this day forever.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.306" end="00:24:20.306" style="s2">Come on. Let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.606" end="00:24:22.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not over yet.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.306" end="00:24:23.906" style="s2">I&#39;ll head back once the dust settles.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.306" end="00:24:25.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you stalling for? Even if it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.906" end="00:24:26.306" style="s2">not for a celebration, you should at</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.206" end="00:24:28.506" style="s2">least go see your uncle, don&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.306" end="00:24:28.506" style="s2">think?</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.606" end="00:24:29.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.506" end="00:24:33.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.607" end="00:24:35.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; think it&#39;s completely ruined down there.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.007" end="00:24:37.107" style="s2">Dad, did you teach Cora a lesson yet?</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.307" end="00:24:39.307" style="s2">SHE NEEDS TO PAY FOR THIS.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.107" end="00:24:42.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IDIOT. You can&#39;t even pull off a cheap</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.307" end="00:24:44.707" style="s2">stunt without getting it recorded.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.107" end="00:24:46.908" style="s2">You&#39;re hopeless. Can&#39;t hold up a wall</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.707" end="00:24:47.807" style="s2">even if you leaned on it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.908" end="00:24:49.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.807" end="00:24:51.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already suspended your brother from</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.307" end="00:24:53.807" style="s2">the company. Once you&#39;re discharged, the</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.307" end="00:24:55.707" style="s2">company is yours to run.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.807" end="00:24:57.408" style="s2">Get your act together. Stop charging</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.707" end="00:24:59.007" style="s2">around like a rabid dog.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.408" end="00:25:02.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.007" end="00:25:04.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get rid of all this crappy decor.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.207" end="00:25:07.007" style="s2">Replace everything and bring me all the</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.408" end="00:25:08.707" style="s2">project files Gavin handled</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.007" end="00:25:09.307" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.707" end="00:25:11.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.307" end="00:25:12.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. Don&#39;t bother bringing them.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.007" end="00:25:14.707" style="s2">Just issue the order. Shut down every</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.507" end="00:25:16.107" style="s2">single one of those projects.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.707" end="00:25:17.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.107" end="00:25:20.107" style="s2">don&#39;t you think you should at least</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.307" end="00:25:22.408" style="s2">review these projects first?</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.107" end="00:25:25.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How stupid are you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.408" end="00:25:27.908" style="s2">Can&#39;t you understand plain speech? I</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.007" end="00:25:29.207" style="s2">said shut them down. Say one more word</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.908" end="00:25:30.007" style="s2">and I&#39;ll have you out the door right</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.207" end="00:25:31.207" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.007" end="00:25:34.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To shut them down, you&#39;ll need to sign</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.207" end="00:25:34.207" style="s2">off on them first.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.607" end="00:25:38.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See that?</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.807" end="00:25:40.807" style="s2">That&#39;s what happens when you back the</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.107" end="00:25:42.107" style="s2">wrong horse.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.807" end="00:25:46.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.107" end="00:25:46.007" style="s2">Please just fire me already, please.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.507" end="00:25:56.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, want to grab dinner tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.507" end="00:25:58.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t think we&#39;re that close, are we?</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.007" end="00:26:02.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can give you what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.908" end="00:26:02.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 8:00, Barton Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.467" end="00:26:08.307" style="s2">[music] I didn&#39;t know what you liked, so</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.707" end="00:26:10.507" style="s2">I just ordered whatever I wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.307" end="00:26:12.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila,</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.507" end="00:26:13.107" style="s2">I never thought we&#39;d we&#39;d actually end</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.007" end="00:26:15.007" style="s2">up [music] having a meal together one</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.107" end="00:26:16.507" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.007" end="00:26:18.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once Gavin and I get married, we&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.507" end="00:26:19.707" style="s2">having meals together anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.107" end="00:26:20.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t you faced reality yet? Gavin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.707" end="00:26:22.107" style="s2">practically [music] throwing himself at</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.807" end="00:26:23.207" style="s2">Cora right now. There&#39;s no way he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.107" end="00:26:24.807" style="s2">marrying you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.207" end="00:26:26.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s just temporarily blinded by</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.807" end="00:26:27.707" style="s2">short-term interests. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.107" end="00:26:30.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? Don&#39;t you go online. The one</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.707" end="00:26:31.107" style="s2">running the company now is me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.358" end="00:26:31.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.107" end="00:26:33.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.908" end="00:26:36.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with that attitude looking down</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.709" end="00:26:36.209" style="s2">on me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.809" end="00:26:39.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, [music] here&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.009" end="00:26:42.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.609" end="00:26:42.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My apologies, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.509" end="00:26:46.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.909" end="00:26:47.909" style="s2">You&#39;ve always been this ill-mannered.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.309" end="00:26:49.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, you don&#39;t have a single card</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.909" end="00:26:52.009" style="s2">left [music] to play. Where do you even</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.309" end="00:26:53.709" style="s2">get the nerve to look down on me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.009" end="00:26:55.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I do is none [music] of your</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.709" end="00:26:56.909" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.309" end="00:26:59.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop pretending. You&#39;re not even a</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.909" end="00:27:00.109" style="s2">biological Orlando heir. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.109" end="00:27:01.909" style="s2">What do you think you still have to</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.109" end="00:27:03.909" style="s2">bargain with?</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.909" end="00:27:06.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bastard, shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.909" end="00:27:07.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, don&#39;t be so naive.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.109" end="00:27:09.003" style="s2">Is shutting up changed the fact that</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.509" end="00:27:09.909" style="s2">you&#39;re adopted?</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.003" end="00:27:11.209" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.909" end="00:27:12.509" style="s2">Don&#39;t you think we&#39;re perfect for each</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.209" end="00:27:14.809" style="s2">other?</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.509" end="00:27:15.609" style="s2">A bastard and a fake. How ironic, how</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.809" end="00:27:17.309" style="s2">well met.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.609" end="00:27:19.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you can&#39;t talk normally, I&#39;m leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.309" end="00:27:21.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay. Sheila, just consider me for</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.409" end="00:27:21.809" style="s2">a second, all right? That loser Gavin is</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.309" end="00:27:23.909" style="s2">finished.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.809" end="00:27:24.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He still has Cora, and he still has my</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.909" end="00:27:26.109" style="s2">father&#39;s support.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.909" end="00:27:28.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly why we should join</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.109" end="00:27:30.009" style="s2">forces, Sheila. If we work together, we</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.309" end="00:27:31.909" style="s2">can push Gavin out of Emerson for good.</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.009" end="00:27:33.109" style="s2">You get it?</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.909" end="00:27:35.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.109" end="00:27:38.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you&#39;ve always looked down on me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.909" end="00:27:40.709" style="s2">Stick with Gavin, and all you&#39;ll get is</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.209" end="00:27:44.309" style="s2">pocket money.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.709" end="00:27:45.509" style="s2">But I can give you shares in Emerson.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.309" end="00:27:47.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you insane?</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.509" end="00:27:48.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my sincerity.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.209" end="00:27:50.109" style="s2">Sheila, I&#39;m serious. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.309" end="00:27:51.809" style="s2">Won&#39;t you at least consider me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.109" end="00:27:53.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin,</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.809" end="00:27:55.309" style="s2">I think I underestimated you before.</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.709" end="00:27:56.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s fine. We&#39;ve got all the time in</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.309" end="00:27:57.309" style="s2">the world to get to know each other</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.309" end="00:27:58.509" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.309" end="00:28:01.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you ever try to play me, you know</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.509" end="00:28:01.109" style="s2">what happens.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.644" end="00:28:08.664" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.109" end="00:28:14.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.509" end="00:28:14.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.909" end="00:28:20.909" style="s2">Know your limits.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.309" end="00:28:23.409" style="s2">Don&#39;t let my father catch [music] on.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.909" end="00:28:24.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you running around with Colin?</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.409" end="00:28:25.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Gavin&#39;s been kicked out of the</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.709" end="00:28:26.709" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.309" end="00:28:28.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you went out to dinner with him?</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.709" end="00:28:30.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But dad,</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.609" end="00:28:32.309" style="s2">since Gavin&#39;s no longer useful, should</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.709" end="00:28:33.610" style="s2">we still continue our cooperation with</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.309" end="00:28:37.710" style="s2">the Emerson family?</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.610" end="00:28:37.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, business goes on as usual.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.410" end="00:28:43.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell? $100,000?</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.210" end="00:28:47.610" style="s2">Gavin, what the hell is wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.210" end="00:28:49.210" style="s2">Why did you send me this much money?</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.610" end="00:28:51.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t want you to be short on cash.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.210" end="00:28:53.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we even that close? Whether I have</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.110" end="00:28:55.010" style="s2">money or not is none of your business.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.010" end="00:28:56.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since they all say I&#39;m your simp, just</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.010" end="00:28:59.710" style="s2">think of it as me paying tribute.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.810" end="00:28:59.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re insane.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.410" end="00:29:03.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.810" end="00:29:04.710" style="s2">your little simp got fired. You know</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.810" end="00:29:05.710" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.710" end="00:29:07.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.710" end="00:29:09.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fresh intel. Gavin got booted from the</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.310" end="00:29:10.110" style="s2">company. Colin axed every single project</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.010" end="00:29:10.510" style="s2">Gavin was handling the second he took</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.110" end="00:29:11.810" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.510" end="00:29:13.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is Colin out of his mind? Does the</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.810" end="00:29:14.110" style="s2">Emerson family have money to burn or</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.110" end="00:29:15.410" style="s2">something?</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.110" end="00:29:17.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows? That guy&#39;s never been all</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.410" end="00:29:18.810" style="s2">there since he was a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.310" end="00:29:19.310" style="s2">Also, I&#39;ve got a bombshell. Want to hear</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.810" end="00:29:20.710" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.310" end="00:29:22.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do you even get all this gossip?</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.710" end="00:29:23.110" style="s2">Did you sneak into the paparazzi or</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.410" end="00:29:24.710" style="s2">something?</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.110" end="00:29:26.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here it is.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.710" end="00:29:28.510" style="s2">Sheila and Colin are hooking up.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.310" end="00:29:31.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Is she insane?</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.510" end="00:29:33.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And they got a room together.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.910" end="00:29:34.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know about that kind of</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.110" end="00:29:36.710" style="s2">private stuff?</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.510" end="00:29:39.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hotel&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.710" end="00:29:39.610" style="s2">And total time they were in and out? 20</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.210" end="00:29:41.620" style="s2">minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.610" end="00:29:42.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, please, no details.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.620" end="00:29:46.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.610" end="00:29:46.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s called logical deduction.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.910" end="00:29:49.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.310" end="00:29:54.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you so quiet?</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.310" end="00:29:55.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila and Colin slept together last</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.710" end="00:29:56.710" style="s2">night. Did you know?</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.810" end="00:29:59.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.710" end="00:30:00.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They slept together. Like, slept</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.110" end="00:30:01.710" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.615" end="00:30:03.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.710" end="00:30:05.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand you don&#39;t have to be so</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.010" end="00:30:07.810" style="s2">blunt. How do you know they got a room?</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.110" end="00:30:09.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have my sources.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.810" end="00:30:10.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what? You look a little wicked</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.010" end="00:30:11.710" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.510" end="00:30:13.810" style="s2">What are you scheming in that head of</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.710" end="00:30:15.510" style="s2">your?</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.810" end="00:30:17.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.510" end="00:30:18.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What work? I thought you got kicked out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.710" end="00:30:20.610" style="s2">You still have the energy to plot</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.910" end="00:30:21.710" style="s2">against Colin?</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.610" end="00:30:23.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does it matter?</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.710" end="00:30:25.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course it matters. I just can&#39;t stand</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.310" end="00:30:27.210" style="s2">him. How are you planning to destroy</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.210" end="00:30:28.610" style="s2">him? Did you get in touch with my dad?</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.210" end="00:30:30.810" style="s2">Why do I get the feeling that old man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.610" end="00:30:32.510" style="s2">pretty fond of you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.810" end="00:30:34.810" style="s2">So Sheila and Colin just slept for</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.510" end="00:30:36.112" style="s2">nothing? Wait, you&#39;re not marrying me</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.810" end="00:30:36.912" style="s2">just for that East District project, are</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.112" end="00:30:38.212" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.912" end="00:30:39.812" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen this kind of drama before.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.212" end="00:30:41.412" style="s2">People like you marry for profit, then</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.812" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">when you get old, you dump your wife and</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.412" end="00:30:45.112" style="s2">go chase models. That&#39;s the whole</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.712" end="00:30:45.112" style="s2">script.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.212" end="00:30:48.212" style="s2">Say something.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.812" end="00:30:50.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not exactly giving me a chance to</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.212" end="00:30:50.712" style="s2">speak.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.412" end="00:30:54.912" style="s2">Do you want to marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.512" end="00:30:57.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s illegal to marry a minor.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.912" end="00:30:59.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe you&#39;re of age.</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.012" end="00:31:00.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My soul is still under 18.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.812" end="00:31:02.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.912" end="00:31:05.412" style="s2">Then why did you come out with me?</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.512" end="00:31:05.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my sugar daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.412" end="00:31:10.512" style="s2">Only two hours of walking and I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.812" end="00:31:12.512" style="s2">already tired. Looks like the rich</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.512" end="00:31:13.312" style="s2">really do fall apart. Are you tired</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.512" end="00:31:15.212" style="s2">already?</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.312" end="00:31:17.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should I be?</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.212" end="00:31:22.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows?</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.912" end="00:31:22.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feel this. Does it feel like I&#39;m tired?</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.612" end="00:31:27.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think you should be tired.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.912" end="00:31:29.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s take a cab back.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.612" end="00:31:33.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the car?</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.512" end="00:31:33.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. No one&#39;s going to steal it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.912" end="00:31:40.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to come up to the third floor?</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.012" end="00:31:43.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I allowed?</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.412" end="00:31:43.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.512" end="00:31:47.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you have anything you like?</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.812" end="00:31:48.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing at all.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.612" end="00:31:51.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a new mall opening in the old</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.812" end="00:31:53.412" style="s2">district. Will you come with me?</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.612" end="00:31:54.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know guys who are too clingy aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.412" end="00:31:56.112" style="s2">attractive, right?</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.912" end="00:31:57.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. I&#39;ll pick you up tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.112" end="00:31:59.412" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.112" end="00:31:59.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.212" end="00:32:08.312" style="s2">Want to check it out?</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.612" end="00:32:09.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know any of them.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.312" end="00:32:12.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither do I. Let&#39;s go meet them</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.912" end="00:32:12.312" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.012" end="00:32:15.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one with the big eyes is so cute.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.547" end="00:32:17.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.712" end="00:32:19.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll get it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.912" end="00:32:22.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about this one?</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.412" end="00:32:22.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of them.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.112" end="00:32:28.812" style="s2">Let me help you organize them.</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.112" end="00:32:30.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.812" end="00:32:31.512" style="s2">Is this the teddy bear?</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.512" end="00:32:32.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.512" end="00:32:34.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty cute.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.512" end="00:32:39.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this one, the one with wings, this</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.812" end="00:32:39.112" style="s2">one&#39;s nice. This one&#39;s nice too.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.213" end="00:32:43.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should get going.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.413" end="00:32:45.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gavin,</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.613" end="00:32:46.913" style="s2">were you happy today?</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.613" end="00:32:49.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.913" end="00:32:49.413" style="s2">Why do you ask?</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.113" end="00:32:54.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you take me to all those stores?</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.313" end="00:32:55.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted your room to feel fuller.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.013" end="00:32:56.113" style="s2">That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.213" end="00:32:58.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.113" end="00:32:58.513" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.813" end="00:33:03.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is so annoying!</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.313" end="00:33:08.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Practicing your freestyle in bed?</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.213" end="00:33:10.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.613" end="00:33:11.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong? You look all defeated.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.113" end="00:33:12.513" style="s2">Spill.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.313" end="00:33:13.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.513" end="00:33:15.513" style="s2">How could he go to all that effort just</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.713" end="00:33:16.513" style="s2">for some stupid project? How can he be</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.513" end="00:33:18.413" style="s2">so calculating?</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.513" end="00:33:21.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I&#39;d call that thoughtful. Pretty</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.413" end="00:33:23.413" style="s2">nice, actually.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.013" end="00:33:25.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. You&#39;re so annoying.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.413" end="00:33:27.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cora, have you ever considered that</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.513" end="00:33:28.613" style="s2">you&#39;re only this frustrated because you</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.113" end="00:33:29.813" style="s2">care?</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.613" end="00:33:31.813" style="s2">Because you want to know if his heart&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.813" end="00:33:33.313" style="s2">real or not.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.813" end="00:33:36.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.313" end="00:33:36.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It means you&#39;ve grown up.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.513" end="00:33:40.513" style="s2">And growing up&#39;s good. Once you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.313" end="00:33:43.613" style="s2">grown, you can be married off for a</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.513" end="00:33:43.613" style="s2">political alliance.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.413" end="00:33:48.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.113" end="00:33:53.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s it going?</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.213" end="00:33:55.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All smooth.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.113" end="00:33:57.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That fool Colin doesn&#39;t suspect a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.313" end="00:33:58.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.313" end="00:34:00.813" style="s2">Give him a little taste. Let him sink in</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.513" end="00:34:00.813" style="s2">deeper.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.613" end="00:34:05.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s starting.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.513" end="00:34:06.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should have started long ago. You really</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.213" end="00:34:07.813" style="s2">not going to</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.913" end="00:34:09.213" style="s2">marry Cora?</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.813" end="00:34:11.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My business</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.213" end="00:34:13.113" style="s2">ain&#39;t nobody else&#39;s concern.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.413" end="00:34:13.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why you try so hard to win her</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.113" end="00:34:15.213" style="s2">over?</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.613" end="00:34:17.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hate is hate.</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.213" end="00:34:20.513" style="s2">Feelings are feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.213" end="00:34:21.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why you act so damn convincing?</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.513" end="00:34:25.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m doing it,</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.713" end="00:34:25.413" style="s2">I&#39;m doing it all the way, right?</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.513" end="00:34:29.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t lose</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.913" end="00:34:31.313" style="s2">everything that belonged to my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.213" end="00:34:32.913" style="s2">I&#39;m taking it all back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.313" end="00:34:35.113" style="s2">No more waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.913" end="00:34:37.013" style="s2">Let&#39;s roll.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.113" end="00:34:37.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, those projects you suspended,</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.013" end="00:34:40.013" style="s2">they&#39;re coming after us for</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.913" end="00:34:41.713" style="s2">accountability.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.013" end="00:34:41.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them come. Ignore them.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.713" end="00:34:43.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.914" end="00:34:46.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; have to pay penalties.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.814" end="00:34:47.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;m stupid?</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.014" end="00:34:50.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.614" end="00:34:50.614" style="s2">get out. Don&#39;t bother me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.914" end="00:34:53.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve confirmed on our end. We&#39;re good</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.314" end="00:34:55.014" style="s2">to go.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.914" end="00:34:56.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For real? When do we sign?</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.014" end="00:34:58.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anytime, but you got to fly over in</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.614" end="00:34:59.014" style="s2">person. Our people can&#39;t make it to your</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.214" end="00:35:00.714" style="s2">side.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.014" end="00:35:03.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.714" end="00:35:03.514" style="s2">I&#39;ll head over tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.014" end="00:35:08.814" style="s2">Sheila, you&#39;re flying with me to Latin</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.914" end="00:35:10.614" style="s2">America tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.814" end="00:35:12.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, that urgent?</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.614" end="00:35:13.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They said yes to our terms. What do you</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.614" end="00:35:15.114" style="s2">think?</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.614" end="00:35:17.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For real?</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.114" end="00:35:18.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For real, Sheila.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.114" end="00:35:20.814" style="s2">I&#39;m going to make you a pianist.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.914" end="00:35:24.014" style="s2">I&#39;ll throw a world tour for you, make</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.814" end="00:35:24.014" style="s2">you a global name.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.114" end="00:35:26.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.114" end="00:35:32.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The flight is ready for takeoff.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.614" end="00:35:34.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this really going to work this time?</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.814" end="00:35:36.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.414" end="00:35:38.614" style="s2">Once we sign that contract, everything</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.814" end="00:35:40.414" style="s2">changes.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.614" end="00:35:42.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are we doing today?</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.414" end="00:35:45.414" style="s2">Spending money every day.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.814" end="00:35:47.314" style="s2">I&#39;m numb to it already.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.414" end="00:35:49.714" style="s2">What&#39;s this? You ain&#39;t going to sell me</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.314" end="00:35:51.414" style="s2">off, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.714" end="00:35:52.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.414" end="00:35:53.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cora.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.514" end="00:35:57.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.614" end="00:35:57.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re sick of me, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.214" end="00:36:01.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I be sick of you?</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.314" end="00:36:02.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;ll be over soon. You won&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.714" end="00:36:05.414" style="s2">put up with me no more.</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.914" end="00:36:07.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I ain&#39;t sick of you. Don&#39;t be so</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.414" end="00:36:11.414" style="s2">down on yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.814" end="00:36:11.414" style="s2">I really ain&#39;t. You hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.514" end="00:36:14.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.280" end="00:36:16.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.314" end="00:36:18.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did that on purpose, didn&#39;t you? I</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.714" end="00:36:18.914" style="s2">just finished eating, and now you bring</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.114" end="00:36:20.614" style="s2">out the fries.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.914" end="00:36:22.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.614" end="00:36:25.014" style="s2">Let&#39;s go for a drive first. Eat when</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.614" end="00:36:25.014" style="s2">you&#39;re hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.914" end="00:36:29.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know,</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.114" end="00:36:32.514" style="s2">I ain&#39;t that big on walking either.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.714" end="00:36:34.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hungry? Want to grab some tacos?</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.514" end="00:36:34.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.714" end="00:36:43.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get your dirty hands off her. Cora, are</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.914" end="00:36:43.516" style="s2">you cheating on me?</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.014" end="00:36:44.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.516" end="00:36:47.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me?</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.616" end="00:36:47.716" style="s2">When were we ever together?</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.816" end="00:36:50.616" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.816" end="00:36:54.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the place I brought you to.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.616" end="00:36:55.016" style="s2">Every time I miss you, I come here for a</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.016" end="00:36:56.816" style="s2">meal</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.016" end="00:36:57.916" style="s2">and then I miss you even more.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.816" end="00:37:00.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just come here because you&#39;re too</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.916" end="00:37:01.416" style="s2">cheap to spend real money, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.316" end="00:37:04.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.416" end="00:37:05.516" style="s2">Maybe a little bit of that too.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.016" end="00:37:07.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You eat tacos too? You even know what</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.516" end="00:37:09.316" style="s2">you&#39;re eating, rich boy?</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.616" end="00:37:11.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Compared to you, my family&#39;s not even in</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.316" end="00:37:13.116" style="s2">the same league.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.216" end="00:37:14.716" style="s2">But I don&#39;t waste money.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.116" end="00:37:16.816" style="s2">I&#39;m just a regular guy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.716" end="00:37:18.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep lying to yourself</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.816" end="00:37:18.716" style="s2">if that makes you feel better, Master</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.116" end="00:37:20.316" style="s2">Winston.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.716" end="00:37:22.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See how classless he is? You can&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.316" end="00:37:24.116" style="s2">with him.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.316" end="00:37:24.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s it to you whether we&#39;re together</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.116" end="00:37:26.116" style="s2">or not?</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.716" end="00:37:27.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two were just holding hands and</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.116" end="00:37:29.016" style="s2">you&#39;re telling me you&#39;re not together?</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.416" end="00:37:30.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was just an itch. He was scratching</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.016" end="00:37:32.616" style="s2">it for me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.416" end="00:37:34.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I &#39;m stupid? We kissed back</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.616" end="00:37:36.416" style="s2">then. You can&#39;t just be a heartbreaker.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.516" end="00:37:39.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kissing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.416" end="00:37:41.316" style="s2">Way more intimate than that.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.116" end="00:37:42.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just end the world already. I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.316" end="00:37:43.616" style="s2">You drove me to my blind date with him,</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.616" end="00:37:44.516" style="s2">remember?</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.616" end="00:37:46.816" style="s2">He ordered coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.516" end="00:37:48.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. You remember it so clearly, Cora.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.816" end="00:37:49.616" style="s2">You do have me in your heart.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.016" end="00:37:50.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you call that intimate</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.616" end="00:37:51.816" style="s2">communication?</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.516" end="00:37:53.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t try to drive a wedge between us.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.816" end="00:37:55.516" style="s2">Cora doesn&#39;t need your money.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.616" end="00:37:56.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who says I don&#39;t? You&#39;re out of your</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.516" end="00:37:57.916" style="s2">damn mind.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.516" end="00:37:59.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You say I&#39;m ruining things between you</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.916" end="00:38:01.316" style="s2">two. How come I stayed at Orlando&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.616" end="00:38:03.216" style="s2">place for over half a month</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.316" end="00:38:04.516" style="s2">and never saw you once? Of course I</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.216" end="00:38:06.716" style="s2">wasn&#39;t at Cora&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.516" end="00:38:08.216" style="s2">Taking a cab there is too expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.716" end="00:38:09.916" style="s2">I can&#39;t bring myself to spend that. So</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.216" end="00:38:11.716" style="s2">how exactly</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.916" end="00:38:13.516" style="s2">do you and Cora maintain this called</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.716" end="00:38:15.516" style="s2">relationship?</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.516" end="00:38:17.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I sent her a friend request. I wrote</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.516" end="00:38:19.516" style="s2">tons of sweet little essays in the</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.516" end="00:38:23.716" style="s2">request message.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.516" end="00:38:23.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did this weirdo even come from?</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.016" end="00:38:27.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where you guys headed? Take me with you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.416" end="00:38:28.916" style="s2">I&#39;m bored out of my mind today.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.116" end="00:38:30.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going shopping. You going to pick</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.916" end="00:38:32.116" style="s2">up the tab?</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.916" end="00:38:33.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh,</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.116" end="00:38:35.516" style="s2">I think I got to head back to the office</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.516" end="00:38:36.616" style="s2">for overtime this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.516" end="00:38:39.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.616" end="00:38:42.016" style="s2">That&#39;s all it takes to handle him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.416" end="00:38:43.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure know how to handle him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.016" end="00:38:44.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.116" end="00:38:45.916" style="s2">Your family loaded or something?</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.716" end="00:38:46.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, you could say that.</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.916" end="00:38:47.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This guy sure loves to put</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.917" end="00:38:48.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; on airs.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.717" end="00:38:51.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.817" end="00:38:51.517" style="s2">Got to get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.717" end="00:38:55.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His family&#39;s that rich? How come he&#39;s so</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.517" end="00:38:58.717" style="s2">cheap?</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.117" end="00:38:58.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heard he was raised by his grandparents.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.317" end="00:39:04.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on? Free shopping spree?</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.917" end="00:39:05.417" style="s2">Card expired? Why is he dropping me off</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.017" end="00:39:06.517" style="s2">right here today?</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.417" end="00:39:07.917" style="s2">That&#39;s [snorts] it? Just dropping me off</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.517" end="00:39:09.817" style="s2">and nothing else to say?</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.917" end="00:39:11.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Busy tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.817" end="00:39:15.317" style="s2">Taking a rain check from you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.617" end="00:39:15.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, all right then. Stay safe.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.617" end="00:39:21.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rich folks minds can never figure them</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.317" end="00:39:21.517" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.317" end="00:39:26.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. We run a tight ship here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.017" end="00:39:27.017" style="s2">Miss your targets and there&#39;s a price to</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.617" end="00:39:28.717" style="s2">pay.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.017" end="00:39:30.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.717" end="00:39:32.917" style="s2">Otherwise I wouldn&#39;t be here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.817" end="00:39:34.017" style="s2">So, about the contract.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.917" end="00:39:35.517" style="s2">Can&#39;t wait to sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.017" end="00:39:37.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The contract</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.517" end="00:39:39.417" style="s2">naturally it&#39;ll be signed. But before</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.917" end="00:39:41.817" style="s2">that</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.417" end="00:39:43.617" style="s2">Miss Orlando&#39;s tour still needs some</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.817" end="00:39:45.017" style="s2">preparing. Would Miss Orlando</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.617" end="00:39:47.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course Miss Orlando mind playing us a</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.017" end="00:39:47.817" style="s2">little tune? She Sheila studied with the</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.017" end="00:39:49.217" style="s2">master.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.817" end="00:39:51.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not playing. I came to discuss the</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.217" end="00:39:52.317" style="s2">tour contract, not to be some sideshow</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.017" end="00:39:55.517" style="s2">entertainment.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.317" end="00:39:55.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just one song, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.717" end="00:40:01.117" style="s2">Show them what you got, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.717" end="00:40:01.117" style="s2">Do it for me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.017" end="00:40:08.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know Miss Orlando</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.817" end="00:40:10.117" style="s2">you&#39;re truly stunning.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.817" end="00:40:12.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where the hell is Colin?</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.117" end="00:40:14.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going to hurt you. Relax. I just</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.617" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">have a thing for beautiful things.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.817" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">Especially beautiful women like you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.717" end="00:40:21.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brilliant.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.917" end="00:40:22.817" style="s2">Truly moving.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.517" end="00:40:24.217" style="s2">Anyone who understands art would be</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.817" end="00:40:26.117" style="s2">captivated.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.217" end="00:40:29.517" style="s2">With talent like that a world tour is</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.117" end="00:40:30.917" style="s2">absolutely worth it, don&#39;t you think?</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.517" end="00:40:32.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean it?</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.917" end="00:40:34.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course Miss Orlando.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.717" end="00:40:36.317" style="s2">You deserve it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.117" end="00:40:37.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much. I won&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.317" end="00:40:39.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry Miss Orlando.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.917" end="00:40:40.417" style="s2">As long as you keep up partnership it</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.217" end="00:40:42.917" style="s2">will be a pleasure.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.417" end="00:40:44.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prodigy pianist returns. The true heir</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.917" end="00:40:47.117" style="s2">to art.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.217" end="00:40:48.717" style="s2">I finally made it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.117" end="00:40:50.118" style="s2">What do you think Sheila&#39;s up to? She</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.717" end="00:40:51.418" style="s2">hasn&#39;t answered calls these past few</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.118" end="00:40:54.318" style="s2">days, and even when she does, she hangs</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.418" end="00:40:55.718" style="s2">up after a couple words. She&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.318" end="00:40:57.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all in the past. It was just an</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.718" end="00:40:59.018" style="s2">accident. No one blames you. Sheila&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.418" end="00:41:01.618" style="s2">just in a bad mood. Let her work through</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.018" end="00:41:01.618" style="s2">it herself.</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.918" end="00:41:05.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Dad, have you had lunch?</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.318" end="00:41:07.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet. Sheila, you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.918" end="00:41:08.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin and I picked up some food. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.518" end="00:41:11.418" style="s2">all have lunch together.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.918" end="00:41:13.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How come you two came together?</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.418" end="00:41:15.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I needed some air earlier, so Colin took</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.218" end="00:41:16.718" style="s2">me out for a few days to clear my head.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.318" end="00:41:17.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two went off on your own, Sheila.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.718" end="00:41:18.318" style="s2">Did you forget what I warned you about</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.918" end="00:41:20.218" style="s2">before?</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.318" end="00:41:21.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, relax. I&#39;ve got some huge news to</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.218" end="00:41:22.318" style="s2">announce today.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.518" end="00:41:23.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What news?</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.318" end="00:41:25.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep you guessing until everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.518" end="00:41:27.518" style="s2">here. I&#39;ll go get them. Hey, second</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.518" end="00:41:30.718" style="s2">brother, come down for lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.518" end="00:41:30.718" style="s2">Cora, come down for lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.318" end="00:41:35.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has Sheila lost her mind?</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.018" end="00:41:36.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I feel it, too.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.518" end="00:41:38.318" style="s2">You don&#39;t think she&#39;s about to announce</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.418" end="00:41:40.818" style="s2">she&#39;s marrying Colin, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.318" end="00:41:42.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. The old man never go for it. You</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.818" end="00:41:43.918" style="s2">don&#39;t think Colin&#39;s throwing money at</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.218" end="00:41:44.918" style="s2">her for some influencer push and that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.918" end="00:41:47.018" style="s2">why she&#39;s so hooked on him?</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.918" end="00:41:48.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like to propose a toast. I was so</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.018" end="00:41:49.918" style="s2">immature before</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.418" end="00:41:50.618" style="s2">caused you all a lot of trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.918" end="00:41:52.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.618" end="00:41:53.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t cry. Smile. You should be</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.118" end="00:41:54.918" style="s2">happy for me. Sheila, you&#39;ll always be</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.818" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">my good daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.918" end="00:41:57.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all, I&#39;m about to have my own solo</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:41:58.118" style="s2">piano co-concert.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.218" end="00:41:59.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.118" end="00:42:01.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the end of the month, I&#39;m putting on</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.318" end="00:42:04.218" style="s2">a solo concert.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.018" end="00:42:05.518" style="s2">You all have to come support me, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.218" end="00:42:09.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you getting the money? A solo</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.518" end="00:42:11.418" style="s2">concert costs at least a million.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.318" end="00:42:14.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, don&#39;t worry about the money.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.418" end="00:42:16.118" style="s2">I&#39;ll take care of it. This is nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.218" end="00:42:18.218" style="s2">Soon Sheila&#39;s concerts will be all over</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.118" end="00:42:19.718" style="s2">the country, even global.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.218" end="00:42:22.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you getting the money? Since</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.718" end="00:42:23.618" style="s2">when is the Emerson family this loaded?</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.018" end="00:42:24.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, just rest easy. I got a friend</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.618" end="00:42:26.318" style="s2">who does investments. He&#39;s got huge</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.918" end="00:42:28.118" style="s2">faith in Sheila, right?</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.318" end="00:42:29.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, he&#39;s fully sponsoring my concert.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.118" end="00:42:31.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is he? What&#39;s his name? What does he</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.618" end="00:42:33.218" style="s2">do? Why is he sponsoring you?</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.618" end="00:42:34.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, aren&#39;t you happy for me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.218" end="00:42:36.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I want to be happy for you,</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.418" end="00:42:36.718" style="s2">but I need to feel at ease about it,</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.018" end="00:42:38.618" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.718" end="00:42:41.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t overthink it. He&#39;s my buddy,</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.618" end="00:42:43.918" style="s2">solid guy, absolutely no problems.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.618" end="00:42:45.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin, what did you just call me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.918" end="00:42:47.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Sheila and I are together now.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.918" end="00:42:48.018" style="s2">We&#39;re family from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.118" end="00:42:49.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila,</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.018" end="00:42:50.718" style="s2">is he telling the truth?</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.018" end="00:42:52.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Colin&#39;s is good man and he truly</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.718" end="00:42:53.520" style="s2">cares about me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.320" end="00:42:54.420" style="s2">We&#39;re going to make it work. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.520" end="00:42:56.320" style="s2">support us, right?</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.420" end="00:42:57.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, since we&#39;re family now,</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.320" end="00:42:59.920" style="s2">why don&#39;t you bring me in on that East</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.020" end="00:42:59.920" style="s2">District project?</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.420" end="00:43:02.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this how all you rich folks do</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.920" end="00:43:03.720" style="s2">business?</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.620" end="00:43:05.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With a voice like that, you don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.720" end="00:43:07.020" style="s2">to whisper it in my ear, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.420" end="00:43:08.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s a family meal, no business</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.020" end="00:43:09.520" style="s2">talks. Company, you take it up with</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.620" end="00:43:10.820" style="s2">Frank later.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.520" end="00:43:12.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you really want in, send the proposal</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.820" end="00:43:13.120" style="s2">to my secretary. I&#39;ll take a look when I</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.020" end="00:43:14.320" style="s2">have time.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.120" end="00:43:16.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think I am about done here. I&#39;m going</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.320" end="00:43:16.720" style="s2">to head out.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.120" end="00:43:20.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Colin was really looking forward to</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.720" end="00:43:20.720" style="s2">today family dinner. It&#39;s just that you</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.420" end="00:43:23.020" style="s2">all</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.720" end="00:43:25.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you even know what you&#39;re saying?</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.020" end="00:43:27.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, just bring Colin along. He&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.320" end="00:43:28.520" style="s2">behave himself.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.120" end="00:43:32.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila,</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.520" end="00:43:33.920" style="s2">you really are a thoughtless child.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.020" end="00:43:34.620" style="s2">Tell Colin to get in touch with your</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.920" end="00:43:36.320" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.620" end="00:43:39.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you said yes.</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.320" end="00:43:39.320" style="s2">I&#39;ll go tell Colin right now.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.020" end="00:43:44.120" style="s2">Disgusting. Don&#39;t smoke in front of me</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.320" end="00:43:45.020" style="s2">ever again.</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.120" end="00:43:46.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done deal.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.020" end="00:43:48.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad said to go see Big Brother,</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.320" end="00:43:49.420" style="s2">remember? To act humble with him.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.220" end="00:43:49.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do I still got to go through your</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.420" end="00:43:51.320" style="s2">brother?</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.920" end="00:43:52.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He runs the company now. Who else you</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.320" end="00:43:54.320" style="s2">going to go to?</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.420" end="00:43:56.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t stand his attitude. Same as</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.320" end="00:43:58.120" style="s2">Gavin, all high and mighty.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.320" end="00:44:00.020" style="s2">Whatever, long as I get my foot in the</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.120" end="00:44:01.820" style="s2">door for the East District project.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.020" end="00:44:04.020" style="s2">Celebrate a little.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.820" end="00:44:05.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so bad.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.020" end="00:44:06.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.220" end="00:44:07.120" style="s2">So annoying.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.420" end="00:44:09.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What now?</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.120" end="00:44:12.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every damn day those two keep booking</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.320" end="00:44:14.020" style="s2">rooms at my place every damn day.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.320" end="00:44:15.620" style="s2">You think Dad really caved</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.020" end="00:44:16.820" style="s2">just now?</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.620" end="00:44:18.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.820" end="00:44:19.120" style="s2">Don&#39;t really care either. Not</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.120" end="00:44:20.920" style="s2">interested.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.120" end="00:44:22.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why&#39;d you cut in when Colin was</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.920" end="00:44:24.220" style="s2">pushing Dad for that project?</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.520" end="00:44:25.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just can&#39;t stand that smug look on that</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.220" end="00:44:27.220" style="s2">Colin guy&#39;s face.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.220" end="00:44:28.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t stand him versus your heart&#39;s only</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.220" end="00:44:30.820" style="s2">got his brother.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.520" end="00:44:30.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.420" end="00:44:37.020" style="s2">What are you doing? Damn, since when am</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.220" end="00:44:38.520" style="s2">I this awkward?</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.020" end="00:44:39.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong? Something happened?</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.520" end="00:44:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I can only call you if something&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.720" end="00:44:42.420" style="s2">wrong? Can I just call you for no</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.520" end="00:44:44.020" style="s2">reason?</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.420" end="00:44:45.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course you can.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.020" end="00:44:46.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.020" end="00:44:47.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just finished dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.020" end="00:44:49.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess who I had lunch with today?</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.920" end="00:44:50.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Winston?</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.020" end="00:44:51.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Screw you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.220" end="00:44:53.220" style="s2">Why would I have lunch with him?</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.620" end="00:44:55.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then who?</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.220" end="00:44:57.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila brought Colin to the house.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.521" end="00:44:58.521" style="s2">You&#39;re not surprised?</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.221" end="00:44:59.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surprised?</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.521" end="00:45:01.221" style="s2">Of course I&#39;m surprised.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.921" end="00:45:02.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not all.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.221" end="00:45:03.721" style="s2">Colin was pushing the old man to let him</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.621" end="00:45:06.621" style="s2">in on the East District project at</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.721" end="00:45:07.621" style="s2">dinner. I steered it away by the way.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.621" end="00:45:09.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.621" end="00:45:10.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s nothing. You were good to me</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.121" end="00:45:13.221" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.321" end="00:45:13.221" style="s2">It&#39;s only right I do the same.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.421" end="00:45:16.721" style="s2">Nothing to say then I&#39;m hanging up.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.721" end="00:45:21.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Sheila&#39;s putting on</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.721" end="00:45:22.821" style="s2">a solo concert.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.621" end="00:45:23.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know that? She tells you</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.821" end="00:45:24.521" style="s2">everything?</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.521" end="00:45:26.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve been reaching out to venues</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.521" end="00:45:28.021" style="s2">these past couple days. The owner&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.321" end="00:45:29.321" style="s2">friend of mine.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.021" end="00:45:31.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.321" end="00:45:32.721" style="s2">Why did he tell you specifically?</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.121" end="00:45:34.921" style="s2">Cuz Sheila&#39;s your ex-fiancé.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.721" end="00:45:35.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Overthinking it. She went with Colin. My</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.921" end="00:45:37.221" style="s2">friend thought it was weird so he gave</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.921" end="00:45:38.821" style="s2">me a heads up.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.221" end="00:45:39.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I see.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.821" end="00:45:41.121" style="s2">Come to think of it I don&#39;t seem to know</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.921" end="00:45:43.021" style="s2">any of your friends but they all know</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.121" end="00:45:43.921" style="s2">Sheila.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.021" end="00:45:45.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to meet them I&#39;ll take you</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.921" end="00:45:48.021" style="s2">to see them tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.821" end="00:45:49.321" style="s2">Got nothing else going on anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.021" end="00:45:50.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nah, we&#39;ll all be there for Sheila&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.321" end="00:45:52.221" style="s2">show anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.621" end="00:45:54.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When&#39;s her show? Let&#39;s go together.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.221" end="00:45:55.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You that eager to see her perform?</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.521" end="00:45:57.921" style="s2">Forget it. Forget it. We&#39;ll figure it</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.521" end="00:45:57.921" style="s2">out later.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.121" end="00:46:01.821" style="s2">Damn it, I lost.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.921" end="00:46:04.921" style="s2">That guy&#39;s so annoying. What the hell</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.821" end="00:46:08.921" style="s2">was I even doing just now?</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.921" end="00:46:08.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t actually want to go see her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.521" end="00:46:12.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second brother.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.921" end="00:46:14.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Man, I really want to plant a bug in</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.621" end="00:46:15.821" style="s2">that presidential suite and hear what</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.521" end="00:46:18.621" style="s2">they&#39;re up to.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.821" end="00:46:20.921" style="s2">But nah, that&#39;s illegal.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.621" end="00:46:24.021" style="s2">Why they got to stay at my hotel?</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.921" end="00:46:26.021" style="s2">This is testing my limits.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.021" end="00:46:27.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you trying to do, plant a bug?</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.021" end="00:46:28.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to plant one in the presidential</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.321" end="00:46:31.521" style="s2">suite</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.821" end="00:46:33.421" style="s2">to eavesdrop on Sheila and Colin.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.521" end="00:46:34.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn, you that twisted?</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.421" end="00:46:36.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just want to know what Sheila and</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.621" end="00:46:38.521" style="s2">Colin are up to.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.521" end="00:46:39.721" style="s2">I&#39;m just thinking about it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.521" end="00:46:41.421" style="s2">Anyway,</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.721" end="00:46:42.321" style="s2">what did you come to me for?</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.421" end="00:46:44.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think Gavin&#39;s really</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.321" end="00:46:45.921" style="s2">thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.021" end="00:46:47.021" style="s2">All that being nice to me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.921" end="00:46:49.621" style="s2">It&#39;s not just cuz he wants the old man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.021" end="00:46:52.021" style="s2">project, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.621" end="00:46:52.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else?</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.121" end="00:46:55.821" style="s2">You think it&#39;s cuz he likes you or</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.421" end="00:46:55.821" style="s2">something?</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.521" end="00:46:59.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with me? Am I not worthy of</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.323" end="00:47:00.823" style="s2">being liked?</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.323" end="00:47:02.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course you are.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.823" end="00:47:04.323" style="s2">But what&#39;s he after? You two just don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.422" end="00:47:05.323" style="s2">seem like a match at all.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.323" end="00:47:06.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell do you know?</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.323" end="00:47:09.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just analyzing here. Why do you have</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.823" end="00:47:09.523" style="s2">to get physical?</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.323" end="00:47:16.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So don&#39;t match. Is it a hair problem?</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.622" end="00:47:21.122" style="s2">Should dye it black again? Ever since I</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.823" end="00:47:22.323" style="s2">went with this color, nobody dares mess</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.122" end="00:47:23.523" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.323" end="00:47:25.422" style="s2">I like the way it makes me look [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.523" end="00:47:26.523" style="s2">like I&#39;m not someone to be messed with.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.422" end="00:47:29.723" style="s2">Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.523" end="00:47:29.723" style="s2">bring Gavin to my performance.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.723" end="00:47:35.823" style="s2">All sold out. Since when did she get</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.422" end="00:47:38.422" style="s2">this popular? Something just feels off.</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.823" end="00:47:38.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paid bots.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.723" end="00:47:42.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But her tickets are actually sold out.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.823" end="00:47:43.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, do you know which sponsor Colin</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.323" end="00:47:45.223" style="s2">hooked Shell up with?</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.622" end="00:47:48.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No idea.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.223" end="00:47:51.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big bro, can&#39;t you just look into it?</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.922" end="00:47:51.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too busy.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.922" end="00:47:56.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask Gavin, see if he knows.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.323" end="00:48:01.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already asked. He said it&#39;s some</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.422" end="00:48:02.723" style="s2">overseas contact. No specifics.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.023" end="00:48:04.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Overseas?</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.723" end="00:48:05.422" style="s2">That school she went to in Europe is a</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.223" end="00:48:08.723" style="s2">joke.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.422" end="00:48:08.723" style="s2">What big shot could she possibly know?</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.422" end="00:48:12.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gavin,</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.523" end="00:48:14.922" style="s2">do I look good today?</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.823" end="00:48:16.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look beautiful in anything.</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.922" end="00:48:18.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So lazy [snorts] with the compliments.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.823" end="00:48:20.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She could be wearing a burlap sack and</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.323" end="00:48:21.523" style="s2">you&#39;d still say she looks good. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.023" end="00:48:24.023" style="s2">not a compliment. That&#39;s just blind</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.523" end="00:48:24.023" style="s2">flattery.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.323" end="00:48:31.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Dad, I am about to go on stage now.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.023" end="00:48:31.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, you are your mother&#39;s pride.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.922" end="00:48:35.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.223" end="00:48:36.523" style="s2">I&#39;m going to give it my all.</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.023" end="00:48:38.922" style="s2">I&#39;m going to prove myself to the whole</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.523" end="00:48:38.922" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.422" end="00:48:46.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you feel like something&#39;s off?</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.823" end="00:48:49.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably Colin&#39;s friend had bought all</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.922" end="00:48:50.422" style="s2">the tickets out of his own pocket.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.223" end="00:48:52.723" style="s2">When you&#39;re new and unknown, you have to</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.422" end="00:48:53.523" style="s2">create the illusion of a sold-out show</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.723" end="00:48:54.523" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.523" end="00:48:55.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.523" end="00:48:57.422" style="s2">that&#39;s how it is.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.922" end="00:48:59.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But with this kind of money throwing,</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.422" end="00:49:01.724" style="s2">it&#39;d take 10 or 8 years just to break</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.422" end="00:49:04.924" style="s2">even. No investor would be stupid enough</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.724" end="00:49:07.624" style="s2">to make such a losing deal.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.924" end="00:49:10.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How come nobody ever invests in me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.624" end="00:49:12.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to put on a concert, too?</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.824" end="00:49:13.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What could I even perform? It&#39;s not like</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.224" end="00:49:15.524" style="s2">I can just stand on stage and curse</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.924" end="00:49:16.724" style="s2">people out.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.524" end="00:49:19.324" style="s2">Well, I guess I could, but I&#39;d probably</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.724" end="00:49:19.324" style="s2">get beaten up.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.924" end="00:49:26.324" style="s2">Great playing. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.524" end="00:49:28.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What was so great about it?</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.324" end="00:49:29.424" style="s2">Did it put you to hear you snoring?</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.124" end="00:49:31.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.424" end="00:49:33.424" style="s2">Being able to cure insomnia, isn&#39;t that</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.124" end="00:49:35.524" style="s2">impressive enough?</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.424" end="00:49:37.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, your piano playing is getting</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.524" end="00:49:38.824" style="s2">better and better. Mom is really proud</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.624" end="00:49:40.424" style="s2">of you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.824" end="00:49:41.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what do you think of my performance</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.424" end="00:49:43.124" style="s2">tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.724" end="00:49:45.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad doesn&#39;t know much about piano, but</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.124" end="00:49:46.924" style="s2">just watching you sit there, you really</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.024" end="00:49:48.524" style="s2">looked like an artist.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.924" end="00:49:51.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, was tonight&#39;s performance up to par?</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.524" end="00:49:52.924" style="s2">I didn&#39;t lie to Sheila, did I?</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.524" end="00:49:54.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You meant well, but you need to</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.924" end="00:49:56.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, when is Big Brother free? The East</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.624" end="00:49:57.924" style="s2">District Project needs to move forward.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.024" end="00:49:59.224" style="s2">I&#39;ve got all the funds ready on my side.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.924" end="00:50:00.024" style="s2">Just waiting to get started with Big</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.224" end="00:50:02.124" style="s2">Brother.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.024" end="00:50:03.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t realize you had that kind of</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.124" end="00:50:04.924" style="s2">financial backing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.524" end="00:50:06.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, it&#39;s nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.924" end="00:50:07.824" style="s2">Still that friend of mine. He said if I</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.424" end="00:50:09.024" style="s2">need more money,</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.824" end="00:50:11.824" style="s2">just ask.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.024" end="00:50:13.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m completely exhausted today.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.824" end="00:50:15.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, who told you to be so talented?</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.924" end="00:50:16.524" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;m counting on my wife to</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.424" end="00:50:18.524" style="s2">support me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.524" end="00:50:20.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such a smooth talker.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.524" end="00:50:23.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You of all people should know</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.324" end="00:50:23.424" style="s2">whether I&#39;m just talking or not.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.724" end="00:50:30.124" style="s2">Are there no other hotels? Must you push</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.824" end="00:50:32.424" style="s2">my limits?</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.124" end="00:50:34.724" style="s2">Screw it. No room bug, then hallway,</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.424" end="00:50:37.524" style="s2">entrance, whatever. Money&#39;s no object.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.724" end="00:50:40.324" style="s2">Buy it all. I refuse to miss one piece</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.524" end="00:50:40.324" style="s2">of gossip.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.224" end="00:50:44.424" style="s2">All clean.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.624" end="00:50:46.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every last trace.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.424" end="00:50:47.524" style="s2">The five mills landed.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.324" end="00:50:50.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.524" end="00:50:52.224" style="s2">Cut the crew their share.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.324" end="00:50:54.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask him. Ask him if he liked what he saw</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.224" end="00:50:54.524" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.724" end="00:50:57.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush?</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.924" end="00:51:00.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh, you&#39;re so annoying.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.924" end="00:51:01.924" style="s2">I&#39;m just scared it didn&#39;t work.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.224" end="00:51:03.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.924" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2">These guys are pros. They know their</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.725" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:51:07.925" end="00:51:11.725" style="s2">Take a good look, babe. See what your</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.725" end="00:51:14.425" style="s2">hubby just scored for you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.725" end="00:51:15.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. This is Oh my god. This means I</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.425" end="00:51:18.925" style="s2">can actually do it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.825" end="00:51:22.225" style="s2">A real concert pianist. World class.</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.925" end="00:51:22.225" style="s2">I love you so much, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.725" end="00:51:27.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Payment sent. You&#39;re in the network.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.825" end="00:51:29.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why here? I thought the recital was</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.325" end="00:51:30.125" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.125" end="00:51:31.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said you didn&#39;t know any of my</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.125" end="00:51:33.825" style="s2">friends.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.725" end="00:51:35.125" style="s2">Figured I&#39;d introduce you to one.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.825" end="00:51:36.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s okay. We&#39;re not even that close</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.125" end="00:51:37.625" style="s2">yet.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.325" end="00:51:38.625" style="s2">Bit early for meet the friends, isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.625" end="00:51:40.225" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.625" end="00:51:41.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Winston.</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.225" end="00:51:44.425" style="s2">Oh yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.725" end="00:51:46.525" style="s2">So who are you close with?</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.425" end="00:51:48.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Winston.</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.525" end="00:51:52.625" style="s2">Can we not talk about that buzz kill?</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.325" end="00:51:52.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. It&#39;s just a chat. No big deal.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.325" end="00:51:57.825" style="s2">Stroll into my turf and don&#39;t even say</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.725" end="00:52:00.525" style="s2">hi.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.825" end="00:52:03.125" style="s2">You having another one of your episodes?</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.525" end="00:52:06.525" style="s2">Well, well. The real Orlando Aris. Hey</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.125" end="00:52:09.025" style="s2">there. Name&#39;s Rex. Gavin&#39;s buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.525" end="00:52:10.325" style="s2">Colin and his crew gone? Gone.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.025" end="00:52:12.125" style="s2">Paid for a full day, only used two</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.325" end="00:52:13.825" style="s2">hours. The Emersons hit the jackpot or</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.125" end="00:52:15.225" style="s2">something. That&#39;s some serious cash.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.825" end="00:52:16.525" style="s2">Guess so. Didn&#39;t see a dime of it</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.225" end="00:52:17.725" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.525" end="00:52:19.225" style="s2">But the money&#39;s paid, so I&#39;m using the</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.725" end="00:52:21.325" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.225" end="00:52:22.725" style="s2">Mooching off my venue. That&#39;s cheap even</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.325" end="00:52:25.125" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.725" end="00:52:26.925" style="s2">You know I&#39;m unemployed now, right?</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.125" end="00:52:28.625" style="s2">Yeah, right. Like you&#39;re hurting for</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.925" end="00:52:29.825" style="s2">cash.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.625" end="00:52:33.325" style="s2">Place is cleared by 10:00 p.m. sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.825" end="00:52:33.325" style="s2">I&#39;m not paying my crew overtime.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.425" end="00:52:36.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s all this?</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.725" end="00:52:39.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said you needed a patron.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.725" end="00:52:39.925" style="s2">Well, now you&#39;ve got one.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.325" end="00:52:47.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, what? Colin&#39;s sponsoring me?</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.625" end="00:52:48.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Him? No, it&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.025" end="00:52:51.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But but Colin&#39;s the one who paid.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.925" end="00:52:52.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he finds out I used his booking to</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.025" end="00:52:54.125" style="s2">hook you up, who do you think he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.725" end="00:52:56.125" style="s2">coming after first?</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.125" end="00:52:58.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Definitely you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.125" end="00:53:01.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.125" end="00:53:02.925" style="s2">So consider this my sponsorship.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.225" end="00:53:05.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re such a cheap scammer.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.925" end="00:53:07.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I&#39;m between jobs, all right?</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.527" end="00:53:08.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You seem pretty happy about it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.827" end="00:53:11.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to give me a piece of your</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.727" end="00:53:12.127" style="s2">mind or what?</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.027" end="00:53:15.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.127" end="00:53:16.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what do you want to do?</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.327" end="00:53:17.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.227" end="00:53:18.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s dance.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.927" end="00:53:20.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.627" end="00:53:21.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who cares? It&#39;s not like we have to</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.327" end="00:53:22.827" style="s2">worry about the audience demanding a</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.327" end="00:53:25.827" style="s2">refund.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.827" end="00:53:25.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we should just go.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.927" end="00:53:32.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.027" end="00:53:32.627" style="s2">You&#39;re a natural.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.127" end="00:53:41.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why the hell weren&#39;t salaries paid this</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.727" end="00:53:43.127" style="s2">month? I&#39;ve got employees coming to me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.927" end="00:53:44.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, really? Uh, let me check with</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.127" end="00:53:45.827" style="s2">accounting.</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.227" end="00:53:47.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT THE HELL AM I PAYING YOU FOR? WHAT</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.827" end="00:53:48.827" style="s2">DO YOU EVEN DO ALL DAY?</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.327" end="00:53:50.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I called you. I sent you a ton of</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.827" end="00:53:53.227" style="s2">messages. You never got back to me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.927" end="00:53:56.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So explain to me why payroll is screwed</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.227" end="00:53:58.327" style="s2">up. It got all the way to my dad.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.727" end="00:53:59.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing in the account.</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.327" end="00:54:00.127" style="s2">Accounting flagged this for you last</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.627" end="00:54:01.527" style="s2">week.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.127" end="00:54:03.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean nothing? There were</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.527" end="00:54:04.827" style="s2">millions. You steal it?</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.327" end="00:54:06.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shut down all of Gavin&#39;s projects</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.827" end="00:54:08.227" style="s2">when we took over.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.527" end="00:54:10.027" style="s2">Those contracts have termination fees.</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.227" end="00:54:11.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to let them sue. Who</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.027" end="00:54:13.727" style="s2">authorized you to pay those fees? You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.927" end="00:54:16.227" style="s2">fired. GET OUT!</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.727" end="00:54:17.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; QUICK, QUICK. THE BOSS JUST FIRED ME.</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.227" end="00:54:18.427" style="s2">Process the paperwork. I want my</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.127" end="00:54:20.727" style="s2">severance.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.427" end="00:54:22.527" style="s2">What the hell are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.727" end="00:54:26.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re fired!</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.527" end="00:54:26.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard that, right? Now process it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.227" end="00:54:31.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Salaries will be paid next month with an</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.227" end="00:54:32.827" style="s2">extra 5% bonus.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.927" end="00:54:34.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.827" end="00:54:35.627" style="s2">so am I fired or not?</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.627" end="00:54:38.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.627" end="00:54:41.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about my severance pay?</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.827" end="00:54:43.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, I know this is a big ask, but</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.627" end="00:54:46.227" style="s2">I need cash fast.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.527" end="00:54:47.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much are we talking?</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.227" end="00:54:50.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50 million.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.527" end="00:54:50.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not pocket change.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.527" end="00:54:53.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.127" end="00:54:55.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to need you to put on 25</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.827" end="00:54:56.652" style="s2">recitals.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.527" end="00:54:59.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.652" end="00:55:01.727" style="s2">[snorts] I&#39;ll make it happen.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.727" end="00:55:02.827" style="s2">Start getting ready, babe. We&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.727" end="00:55:05.327" style="s2">full throttle.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.827" end="00:55:06.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That many shows in that short a time?</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.327" end="00:55:07.628" style="s2">That&#39;s crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.327" end="00:55:10.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chulia, I signed the</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.628" end="00:55:11.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; contract under the company&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.128" end="00:55:14.028" style="s2">If I get kicked out.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.928" end="00:55:15.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, set it up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.028" end="00:55:19.528" style="s2">But be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.528" end="00:55:19.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ve got it all handled.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.928" end="00:55:32.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at this dumb question.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.128" end="00:55:35.828" style="s2">Some idiot asked, how does she compare</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.328" end="00:55:37.728" style="s2">to real world class pianists?</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.828" end="00:55:38.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? I know I&#39;m not at that</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.728" end="00:55:40.428" style="s2">level yet.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.328" end="00:55:42.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, hey, don&#39;t get mad.</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.428" end="00:55:44.328" style="s2">I know how hard you&#39;re working. Tell you</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.428" end="00:55:47.428" style="s2">what, I&#39;ll buy you an award.</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.328" end="00:55:48.428" style="s2">A real one with some weight to it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.428" end="00:55:51.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re serious?</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.428" end="00:55:51.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.528" end="00:55:57.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin, what in the hell are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.428" end="00:55:58.128" style="s2">Our company accounts are frozen. What is</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.328" end="00:56:00.328" style="s2">going on?</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.128" end="00:56:01.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Frozen? It It wasn&#39;t me. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.328" end="00:56:03.128" style="s2">do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.128" end="00:56:05.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just got a notice. An $8 million</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.128" end="00:56:06.928" style="s2">deposit from two days ago was flagged</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.128" end="00:56:08.828" style="s2">for you know money laundering. And</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.928" end="00:56:10.228" style="s2">you&#39;re telling me it&#39;s wrong with you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.828" end="00:56:12.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What just</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.228" end="00:56:13.928" style="s2">Just give me a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.633" end="00:56:15.528" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.928" end="00:56:17.428" style="s2">You told me the money was clean. Now my</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.528" end="00:56:18.928" style="s2">company&#39;s accounts are frozen.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.428" end="00:56:20.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Must have been a screw up on my guy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.928" end="00:56:23.228" style="s2">end. Don&#39;t worry about it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.228" end="00:56:24.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry? How can I not worry?</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.228" end="00:56:26.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve paid you more than enough. Keep</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.628" end="00:56:27.028" style="s2">your head down [clears throat] and stay</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.228" end="00:56:28.228" style="s2">out of trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.028" end="00:56:30.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the company goes under, I&#39;m done. My</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.228" end="00:56:30.928" style="s2">dad will kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.428" end="00:56:35.928" style="s2">What do I do?</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.228" end="00:56:37.328" style="s2">How do I spin this?</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.928" end="00:56:38.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shelia, we&#39;ve got a huge problem. The</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.328" end="00:56:41.828" style="s2">transfer from that partner got flagged</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.928" end="00:56:42.928" style="s2">and now the accounts are frozen.</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.828" end="00:56:44.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are they going to come after me? Am I</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.928" end="00:56:45.728" style="s2">going to get dragged into this?</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.528" end="00:56:47.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shelia,</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.728" end="00:56:49.028" style="s2">your dad has connections.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.528" end="00:56:50.928" style="s2">You need to go to him.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.028" end="00:56:52.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should I clean up your mess? He</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.928" end="00:56:54.128" style="s2">doesn&#39;t listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.628" end="00:56:56.528" style="s2">If I go to him for something like this,</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.128" end="00:56:57.828" style="s2">I&#39;m done. I&#39;ll lose everything.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.528" end="00:56:59.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;d be asking if I had any</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.828" end="00:57:01.928" style="s2">other choice?</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.928" end="00:57:04.228" style="s2">Do you want to be a pianist or not? Go</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.928" end="00:57:08.028" style="s2">see your father now. If this doesn&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.228" end="00:57:08.028" style="s2">fixed, we are both screwed.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.619" end="00:57:11.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.229" end="00:57:17.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheila, you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.829" end="00:57:19.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.229" end="00:57:21.229" style="s2">I&#39;ve been so exhausted lately. I feel</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.029" end="00:57:23.429" style="s2">like I can&#39;t hold on much longer.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.229" end="00:57:25.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest when you need to. Dad&#39;s not so down</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.429" end="00:57:28.429" style="s2">and out that I can&#39;t support you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.929" end="00:57:30.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Supporting me is like keeping a dog.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.429" end="00:57:32.429" style="s2">Just toss me some food and who cares</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.229" end="00:57:33.529" style="s2">what I actually want.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.429" end="00:57:35.329" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.529" end="00:57:37.329" style="s2">Colin&#39;s been working on some project</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.329" end="00:57:39.749" style="s2">with someone. The company just got a</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.329" end="00:57:41.029" style="s2">payment and then the account got frozen.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.749" end="00:57:41.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.029" end="00:57:43.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.829" end="00:57:44.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows? I asked him, but he wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.329" end="00:57:46.029" style="s2">tell me. It&#39;s got me so worried.</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.929" end="00:57:47.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That means he&#39;s grown up. He doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.029" end="00:57:48.029" style="s2">want you to worry and be scared with</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.429" end="00:57:49.329" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.029" end="00:57:51.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.329" end="00:57:52.029" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;m really worried. Can you help</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.329" end="00:57:53.129" style="s2">him out?</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.029" end="00:57:56.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.129" end="00:57:58.429" style="s2">I&#39;ll make a call and ask around for you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.829" end="00:57:59.229" style="s2">I&#39;d like to ask about Colin Emerson&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.429" end="00:58:01.029" style="s2">company account.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.229" end="00:58:02.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Orlando, this involves international</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.029" end="00:58:03.229" style="s2">financial fraud. I&#39;m afraid I can&#39;t help</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.729" end="00:58:06.429" style="s2">you either.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.229" end="00:58:08.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; International financial fraud?</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.429" end="00:58:10.029" style="s2">Sheila said it was just a normal</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.129" end="00:58:11.529" style="s2">investment. How did it turn into</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.029" end="00:58:13.029" style="s2">international fraud?</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.529" end="00:58:16.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; say Colin Emerson is tied to a</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.029" end="00:58:16.929" style="s2">transnational telecom fraud ring.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.229" end="00:58:21.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.729" end="00:58:22.729" style="s2">what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.029" end="00:58:25.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who exactly was that investor you</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.729" end="00:58:25.929" style="s2">mentioned before?</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.529" end="00:58:30.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, why are you asking that?</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.129" end="00:58:34.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because Colin is in serious trouble this</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.029" end="00:58:34.029" style="s2">time. Do you understand?</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.229" end="00:58:38.029" style="s2">Someone reported him for participating</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.729" end="00:58:39.629" style="s2">in transnational fraud.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.029" end="00:58:41.129" style="s2">Give it to me straight.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.629" end="00:58:43.429" style="s2">What&#39;s really going on? Where was that</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.129" end="00:58:44.529" style="s2">investor from? Why did he invest in you?</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.429" end="00:58:46.929" style="s2">What did you do for him?</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.529" end="00:58:50.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I I need to go find Colin. Yeah, I</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.929" end="00:58:50.129" style="s2">need to go to Colin first.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.029" end="00:58:58.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank, your sister&#39;s gotten herself into</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.129" end="00:59:01.429" style="s2">big trouble. We need to handle this.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.929" end="00:59:03.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin, are you crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.429" end="00:59:05.329" style="s2">The authorities are already onto us. You</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.429" end="00:59:08.129" style="s2">ruined me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.329" end="00:59:10.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We got reported?</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.129" end="00:59:11.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GAVIN, THIS HAS TO BE YOU MESSING WITH</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.329" end="00:59:14.531" style="s2">ME.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.929" end="00:59:16.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GAVIN, come back,</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.531" end="00:59:18.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We built this company together.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.931" end="00:59:21.331" style="s2">Think of your mother. She poured her</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.231" end="00:59:24.531" style="s2">heart and soul into this family.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.331" end="00:59:26.431" style="s2">You know very well what she gave.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.531" end="00:59:28.331" style="s2">You&#39;re not worthy to mention her. I know</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.431" end="00:59:30.231" style="s2">I&#39;ve failed you all, but</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.331" end="00:59:33.231" style="s2">can you really bear to watch her life&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.231" end="00:59:34.931" style="s2">work be destroyed? From now on,</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.231" end="00:59:36.931" style="s2">Colin is not to meddle in any company</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.931" end="00:59:39.131" style="s2">business. Okay, no problem. I&#39;ll send</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.931" end="00:59:41.131" style="s2">him abroad to reflect. Once the company</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.131" end="00:59:43.331" style="s2">stabilizes, I&#39;ll bring Colin back.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.131" end="00:59:43.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.331" end="00:59:47.031" style="s2">Colin.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.931" end="00:59:49.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Gavin is trying to destroy me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.031" end="00:59:50.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You idiot, shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.131" end="00:59:51.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.231" end="00:59:54.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company will be handed over to him</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.831" end="00:59:57.131" style="s2">from now on. He&#39;ll clean up this mess.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.331" end="00:59:58.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But then what about me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.131" end="01:00:00.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you have what it takes to fix</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.631" end="01:00:02.131" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.131" end="01:00:05.631" style="s2">Get your ass home right now and explain</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.131" end="01:00:05.631" style="s2">everything from start to finish.</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.731" end="01:00:10.031" style="s2">He dares to hang up on me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.131" end="01:00:12.431" style="s2">He&#39;s the one who caused this mess.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.031" end="01:00:14.731" style="s2">Gavin, poor boy.</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.431" end="01:00:18.131" style="s2">The blow of losing Gavin &#39;s mother has</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.731" end="01:00:18.131" style="s2">affected Gavin too much.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.231" end="01:00:23.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even Mr. Orlando couldn&#39;t handle this.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.731" end="01:00:26.121" style="s2">And he fixed it in two days back. How is</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.631" end="01:00:27.131" style="s2">that possible?</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.121" end="01:00:29.431" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.131" end="01:00:31.531" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.431" end="01:00:34.331" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you answer my calls before?</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.531" end="01:00:35.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say your company was frozen?</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.331" end="01:00:37.231" style="s2">I&#39;ve been figuring out a solution for</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.831" end="01:00:38.231" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.231" end="01:00:40.431" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.231" end="01:00:41.631" style="s2">it&#39;s unlocked now. Want to keep working</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.431" end="01:00:42.831" style="s2">together?</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.631" end="01:00:44.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean? You&#39;re saying you came</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.831" end="01:00:46.231" style="s2">up with the solution? Wasn&#39;t it Wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.931" end="01:00:47.931" style="s2">it our own idea?</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.231" end="01:00:49.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spent millions bribing people to</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.931" end="01:00:51.131" style="s2">grease the wheels for you. Don&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.531" end="01:00:52.231" style="s2">think about playing me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.131" end="01:00:54.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, never.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.231" end="01:00:56.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll help you bury this. Are you sure</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.331" end="01:00:58.531" style="s2">you still want to go through with it?</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.031" end="01:00:59.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.531" end="01:01:02.331" style="s2">I have to find a way to get rid of Gavin</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.831" end="01:01:02.331" style="s2">for good.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.431" end="01:01:07.531" style="s2">Hasn&#39;t Gavin</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.131" end="01:01:09.331" style="s2">come to see you for a few days now?</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.531" end="01:01:11.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None of your business.</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.331" end="01:01:11.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to know why?</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.131" end="01:01:13.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.831" end="01:01:16.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.231" end="01:01:16.532" style="s2">he doesn&#39;t need you anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.532" end="01:01:24.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, he&#39;s back at Emerson Corp. Now you</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.132" end="01:01:25.632" style="s2">finally get why he was buttering you up.</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.032" end="01:01:27.332" style="s2">Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.632" end="01:01:29.532" style="s2">Colin&#39;s a worthless piece of trash and</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.332" end="01:01:31.132" style="s2">the old man finally sees it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.532" end="01:01:33.232" style="s2">Since Colin failed, the company</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.132" end="01:01:35.232" style="s2">naturally belongs to Gavin now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.232" end="01:01:36.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you have anything else to do? Even</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.232" end="01:01:38.532" style="s2">if it&#39;s just finding something anything</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.932" end="01:01:40.932" style="s2">to occupy yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.532" end="01:01:43.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I run a hotel.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.932" end="01:01:45.032" style="s2">Wait, wait.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.132" end="01:01:48.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So all of Gavin &#39;s kindness towards me</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.032" end="01:01:50.632" style="s2">was just to get back into the company.</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.232" end="01:01:52.332" style="s2">Now that he&#39;s back, I&#39;m useless.</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.632" end="01:01:55.332" style="s2">I&#39;ve become a tool.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.332" end="01:01:56.832" style="s2">So I was just a tool.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.332" end="01:01:58.732" style="s2">Forget it. It&#39;s not like I ever asked to</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.832" end="01:02:02.632" style="s2">be part of all this.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.732" end="01:02:02.632" style="s2">I&#39;m tired of these high society games.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.532" end="01:02:06.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cora, dinner&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.338" end="01:02:08.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.532" end="01:02:10.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not eating. Come down and have a little</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.732" end="01:02:12.332" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.032" end="01:02:14.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Skipping dinner is bad for your stomach.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.332" end="01:02:17.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to skip dinner all the time</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.432" end="01:02:18.932" style="s2">and I was fine.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.032" end="01:02:20.532" style="s2">I&#39;ve been at the Orlando&#39;s too long. I</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.932" end="01:02:23.632" style="s2">never used to have time for these</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.532" end="01:02:23.632" style="s2">girlish feelings before.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.332" end="01:02:29.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eating a little later is fine too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.332" end="01:02:36.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just going to McDonald&#39;s. I&#39;m just</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.532" end="01:02:38.832" style="s2">an ordinary girl.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.932" end="01:02:41.232" style="s2">All I want is a burger and fried</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.832" end="01:02:41.232" style="s2">chicken.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.532" end="01:02:47.132" style="s2">This is what life&#39;s all about.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.132" end="01:02:55.232" style="s2">Ah,</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.132" end="01:02:55.232" style="s2">that hits the spot. I &#39;m stuffed.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.932" end="01:03:01.032" style="s2">Why are you driving this?</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.332" end="01:03:02.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.032" end="01:03:05.632" style="s2">drives fine.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.332" end="01:03:07.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It drives fine, but it&#39;s not for you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.632" end="01:03:10.532" style="s2">I&#39;m going home. Don&#39;t contact me anymore</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.432" end="01:03:10.532" style="s2">and stay away from my car.</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.232" end="01:03:15.432" style="s2">STOP FOLLOWING ME.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.232" end="01:03:15.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEN PULL OVER FIRST. I NEED to talk to</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.432" end="01:03:17.132" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.732" end="01:03:20.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk about what?</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.132" end="01:03:20.133" style="s2">Do I even know you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.733" end="01:03:24.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just stop. It&#39;s dangerous.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.933" end="01:03:27.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None of your business.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.333" end="01:03:31.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T RIDE SO FAST. It&#39;s not safe.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.333" end="01:03:31.233" style="s2">Cora, RED LIGHTS. STOP.</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.233" end="01:03:46.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GAVIN.</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.633" end="01:03:48.533" style="s2">DON&#39;T BLAME ME.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.533" end="01:03:50.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COLIN, HAVE you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.533" end="01:03:51.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YEAH, I HAVE. YOU PUSHED ME TO IT. WHY</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.333" end="01:03:52.933" style="s2">DID YOU HAVE TO COME BACK? And that</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.833" end="01:03:54.333" style="s2">account, you lied to me. You never</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.933" end="01:03:57.033" style="s2">unlocked it, did you, you liar?</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.333" end="01:03:59.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t. And dad, all he ever did was</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.033" end="01:04:01.433" style="s2">play favorites. Goodbye, Gavin.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.833" end="01:04:03.033" style="s2">From now on, the company&#39;s all mine.</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.433" end="01:04:04.133" style="s2">Dad&#39;s got no other choice, and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.033" end="01:04:06.633" style="s2">never have to worry about getting kicked</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.133" end="01:04:06.633" style="s2">out again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.933" end="01:04:15.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GAVIN.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.133" end="01:04:22.533" style="s2">CORA.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.333" end="01:04:28.733" style="s2">DON&#39;T SLEEP. DO YOU HEAR ME?</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.933" end="01:04:39.333" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE AWAKE. You okay? Just hold on.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.533" end="01:04:40.533" style="s2">Too remote out here, no cabs. I&#39;ll walk</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.333" end="01:04:42.233" style="s2">a bit further, get a ride, and we&#39;ll hit</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.533" end="01:04:42.933" style="s2">the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.233" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hospital?</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.933" end="01:04:45.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you insane?</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.133" end="01:04:46.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go back. I have to go back.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.433" end="01:04:47.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay still. Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.933" end="01:04:49.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to go back.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.833" end="01:04:50.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? That car&#39;s toast, just a pile of</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.933" end="01:04:53.033" style="s2">scrap metal.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.933" end="01:04:55.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The dash cam. I need the footage.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.033" end="01:04:56.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gone. Colin burned it all to ashes.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.133" end="01:04:58.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He actually went through with it. I knew</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.933" end="01:04:59.533" style="s2">he was twisted, but he&#39;s crazy.</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.133" end="01:05:00.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. I got it all on video. I was</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.533" end="01:05:02.233" style="s2">already watching my back. He&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.733" end="01:05:03.033" style="s2">getting away. Now no more talk.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.233" end="01:05:04.133" style="s2">Hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.033" end="01:05:05.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.133" end="01:05:07.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you so stubborn?</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.533" end="01:05:07.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.033" end="01:05:09.533" style="s2">I can walk.</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.833" end="01:05:10.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re playing with your life here.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.533" end="01:05:12.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you call the cops?</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.533" end="01:05:13.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, I&#39;m such an idiot. I should have</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.133" end="01:05:15.333" style="s2">dialed 911 already.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.333" end="01:05:17.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t. Please.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.333" end="01:05:17.833" style="s2">Go home. Don&#39;t tell anyone you saw me</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.333" end="01:05:19.833" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.833" end="01:05:21.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? Colin&#39;s the criminal. Why are you</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.833" end="01:05:23.335" style="s2">hiding? If you don&#39;t me a reason, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.135" end="01:05:25.635" style="s2">deleting the video. No more games.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.335" end="01:05:28.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t delete it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.635" end="01:05:30.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then spill it, or I&#39;ll turn you in, too.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.335" end="01:05:32.135" style="s2">See how you hide then.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.935" end="01:05:34.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were never supposed to be part of</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.135" end="01:05:34.735" style="s2">this plan.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.435" end="01:05:41.335" style="s2">The car accident was part of my plan,</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.335" end="01:05:42.435" style="s2">but it wasn&#39;t supposed to happen</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.335" end="01:05:43.535" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.435" end="01:05:44.735" style="s2">That account is only temporarily</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.535" end="01:05:46.435" style="s2">unfrozen will collapse again in two</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.735" end="01:05:47.935" style="s2">weeks. I had to give the company back to</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.435" end="01:05:49.335" style="s2">Colin</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.935" end="01:05:50.235" style="s2">and let him destroy himself with his own</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.335" end="01:05:51.735" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.235" end="01:05:55.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.735" end="01:05:58.435" style="s2">how did he know where you&#39;d be tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.235" end="01:06:00.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably my cousin Caesar.</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.435" end="01:06:02.535" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry I dragged you into this.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.635" end="01:06:04.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what were you planning to do after</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.535" end="01:06:06.735" style="s2">you had your accident?</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.135" end="01:06:08.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caesar rented an apartment for me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.735" end="01:06:10.135" style="s2">I was planning to lay low there for two</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.535" end="01:06:12.235" style="s2">weeks</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.135" end="01:06:14.135" style="s2">until things blew over.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.235" end="01:06:15.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the company?</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.135" end="01:06:17.735" style="s2">How are you going to get it back?</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.735" end="01:06:19.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never wanted the company.</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.735" end="01:06:22.035" style="s2">I only wanted the 800 million my mother</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.935" end="01:06:23.335" style="s2">left behind,</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.035" end="01:06:25.735" style="s2">and I&#39;ve already got it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.335" end="01:06:27.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So all of this was your setup?</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.735" end="01:06:29.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just gave them enough rope to hang</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.735" end="01:06:31.835" style="s2">themselves with.</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.435" end="01:06:33.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re really cold-blooded.</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.835" end="01:06:34.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.235" end="01:06:36.335" style="s2">sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.335" end="01:06:37.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you apologizing?</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.335" end="01:06:39.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This had nothing to do with you in the</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.635" end="01:06:42.035" style="s2">first place.</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.635" end="01:06:44.535" style="s2">I&#39;m the one who put you in danger.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.035" end="01:06:46.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really deserve to die. You can&#39;t go</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.535" end="01:06:47.935" style="s2">there now.</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.135" end="01:06:50.135" style="s2">So what are you going to do?</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.935" end="01:06:51.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.135" end="01:06:52.435" style="s2">It&#39;s only two weeks. They&#39;ll pass</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.835" end="01:06:54.935" style="s2">quickly.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.435" end="01:06:56.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come with me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.935" end="01:06:58.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.435" end="01:07:00.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll find you a place to crash. You want</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.335" end="01:07:03.135" style="s2">to sleep on the dirt?</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.535" end="01:07:03.135" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.835" end="01:07:08.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this okay?</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.135" end="01:07:10.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up and get in.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.935" end="01:07:10.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, but this place is pretty run</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.135" end="01:07:12.535" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.635" end="01:07:16.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, watch your mouth. I used to live in</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.535" end="01:07:16.335" style="s2">places like this and it wasn&#39;t that bad.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.135" end="01:07:20.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is water.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.535" end="01:07:23.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just old pipes. Let it run for a</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.935" end="01:07:23.236" style="s2">bit and the rust water will clear up.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.035" end="01:07:24.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.236" end="01:07:27.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we really staying here?</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.936" end="01:07:27.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have somewhere else to go?</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.936" end="01:07:32.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.436" end="01:07:33.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait here. When the water runs clear,</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.236" end="01:07:36.536" style="s2">wash your face.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.336" end="01:07:36.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it really was just rust?</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.736" end="01:07:39.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your clothes off.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.136" end="01:07:44.736" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.436" end="01:07:46.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you tell me tell me to take my</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.736" end="01:07:48.736" style="s2">clothes off?</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.736" end="01:07:50.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to take off your jacket. Why</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.736" end="01:07:52.836" style="s2">are you taking off your shirt? Never</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.536" end="01:07:53.936" style="s2">mind. It&#39;s not even cold anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.836" end="01:07:55.136" style="s2">Take your clothes off and wipe yourself</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.936" end="01:07:56.736" style="s2">down with cold water. It&#39;ll make you</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.136" end="01:07:58.236" style="s2">feel better.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.736" end="01:07:59.536" style="s2">I swear I&#39;m absolutely not looking at</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.236" end="01:08:02.036" style="s2">your abs. I&#39;m just particular about</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.536" end="01:08:04.136" style="s2">personal hygiene. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.036" end="01:08:06.436" style="s2">Wait. I I wasn&#39;t looking at you. I was</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.136" end="01:08:08.136" style="s2">just about to say something.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.436" end="01:08:10.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can look.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.136" end="01:08:11.936" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.136" end="01:08:13.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t going to look at you anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.936" end="01:08:15.136" style="s2">Your body&#39;s just so so.</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.536" end="01:08:18.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.136" end="01:08:18.136" style="s2">I&#39;ll work out more later.</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.236" end="01:08:21.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, the lean type you&#39;ve got right now</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.636" end="01:08:22.936" style="s2">is just right.</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.436" end="01:08:25.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.936" end="01:08:27.336" style="s2">you like this type?</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.036" end="01:08:29.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever. Just go wash up.</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.336" end="01:08:31.836" style="s2">I&#39;m exhausted.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.936" end="01:08:34.236" style="s2">Dust this off. We&#39;ll crash here for</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.836" end="01:08:37.936" style="s2">tonight. Just one night.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.236" end="01:08:38.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me do it. You go wash your face.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.936" end="01:08:41.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.936" end="01:08:43.936" style="s2">Me? Is he going to watch me again? Isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.536" end="01:08:45.536" style="s2">this moving a little fast?</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.936" end="01:08:47.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t overthink it.</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.536" end="01:08:49.836" style="s2">You&#39;ve got dust on your face. Wipe it</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.436" end="01:08:53.136" style="s2">off so you&#39;re cleaner.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.836" end="01:08:53.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pull yourself together, Cora.</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.436" end="01:09:00.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this clean enough?</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.336" end="01:09:02.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.336" end="01:09:03.536" style="s2">We&#39;re not staying long anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.236" end="01:09:05.436" style="s2">Once we make some money tomorrow, we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.536" end="01:09:07.436" style="s2">get a motel.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.436" end="01:09:09.136" style="s2">Cold?</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.436" end="01:09:11.136" style="s2">Want to move a little closer?</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.136" end="01:09:12.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.136" end="01:09:14.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not cold at all. Your body&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.736" end="01:09:16.136" style="s2">burning hot.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.236" end="01:09:19.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.136" end="01:09:19.236" style="s2">I am a little cold.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.436" end="01:09:23.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm, don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.236" end="01:09:30.938" style="s2">If Cora doesn&#39;t hold me how am I</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.938" end="01:09:30.938" style="s2">supposed to fall asleep?</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.052" end="01:09:35.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
